1
00:00:03,580 --> 00:02:03,580
Please contact turkision@gmail.com for any inquiries

2
00:02:04,085 --> 00:02:07,475
No living being was harmed
during the filming of this series.

3
00:02:08,883 --> 00:02:11,895
Episode 110

4
00:02:27,245 --> 00:02:28,655
Commander Samagar.

5
00:02:28,675 --> 00:02:30,465
They have gone in this direction.

6
00:02:30,525 --> 00:02:34,315
I will separate your flesh
from your bones, Osman.

7
00:02:34,685 --> 00:02:36,575
I swear by Erlik Khan.

8
00:02:37,255 --> 00:02:38,605
Walk.

9
00:02:46,450 --> 00:02:49,030
You've got yourself
into big trouble, Osman Bey.

10
00:02:49,100 --> 00:02:51,610
Adults have great concerns, Hadrat Sultan.

11
00:02:51,710 --> 00:02:53,290
Do not worry at all.

12
00:02:54,040 --> 00:02:56,510
This is a matter you did
not have to get involved.

13
00:02:57,150 --> 00:02:59,830
You will lose your
little tribe because of me.

14
00:03:01,440 --> 00:03:08,460
Your loss of position and rule did not
make you lose any of your pride.

15
00:03:19,790 --> 00:03:22,070
What are the Alps
busy with, Osman Bey?

16
00:03:23,180 --> 00:03:24,720
We got off the horses.

17
00:03:25,250 --> 00:03:26,720
And now we stand like this.

18
00:03:29,410 --> 00:03:31,610
You have been with them for many years.

19
00:03:32,580 --> 00:03:35,050
But you never knew the Mongols.

20
00:03:35,790 --> 00:03:39,800
For this reason, you had to fight them.

21
00:03:41,170 --> 00:03:43,180
They are skillful in tracking.

22
00:03:44,330 --> 00:03:46,410
What you said is just criticism.

23
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:49,380
You didn't answer my question, Osman Bey.

24
00:03:49,700 --> 00:03:52,270
Alps turned the horseshoes.

25
00:03:52,990 --> 00:03:55,700
So they will think we've gone to
the opposite direction.

26
00:03:58,680 --> 00:04:02,250
However, we will not go on horseback.

27
00:04:04,750 --> 00:04:07,310
Surviving the Mongols
by running away is difficult.

28
00:04:07,530 --> 00:04:09,540
We must mislead them, at least.

29
00:04:10,730 --> 00:04:12,470
Will they believe this?

30
00:04:12,490 --> 00:04:14,570
At least, that's how we'll divide them up.

31
00:04:20,250 --> 00:04:21,769
Is everything ready?

32
00:04:21,850 --> 00:04:23,210
Are the Alps ready?

33
00:04:23,240 --> 00:04:24,630
Yes, my Bey.

34
00:04:24,710 --> 00:04:26,290
Okay.

35
00:04:33,700 --> 00:04:35,270
Alps!

36
00:04:35,310 --> 00:04:37,330
Get rid of the horses and follow us!

37
00:04:39,090 --> 00:04:40,590
Hadrat Sultan

38
00:04:50,210 --> 00:04:53,000
Konya Palace

39
00:04:54,545 --> 00:04:58,135
My uncle who sits at home
and waits for his death...

40
00:04:58,865 --> 00:05:01,185
runs away when the day
comes to kill him, right?

41
00:05:01,275 --> 00:05:03,705
Osman, Hadrat Sultan.

42
00:05:04,735 --> 00:05:07,275
The reason he came
here was to take Mesut.

43
00:05:08,125 --> 00:05:10,125
He also took his son from the palace.

44
00:05:10,155 --> 00:05:12,115
- Also...
- Vizier!

45
00:05:18,085 --> 00:05:19,965
This is my last warning to you.

46
00:05:21,845 --> 00:05:24,125
Never come to me with excuses again.

47
00:05:27,805 --> 00:05:29,135
Take an army with you.

48
00:05:34,115 --> 00:05:36,665
Kill my uncle and Osman
and bring them to me.

49
00:05:40,355 --> 00:05:41,715
However...

50
00:05:43,165 --> 00:05:46,375
if you lie...

51
00:05:49,715 --> 00:05:51,895
I'm going to hang you
in the square, Saveli.

52
00:06:21,895 --> 00:06:23,255
Commander Samagar.

53
00:06:23,585 --> 00:06:25,375
The traces point in this direction.

54
00:06:43,365 --> 00:06:45,535
These traces do not lead to Yenişehir.

55
00:06:46,315 --> 00:06:48,845
Osman and his Alps
will not go in this direction.

56
00:06:54,595 --> 00:06:55,695
Samagar.

57
00:06:55,755 --> 00:06:57,655
The traces point in this direction.

58
00:07:12,385 --> 00:07:14,895
Since when you can say your opinions?

59
00:07:16,605 --> 00:07:17,935
Look.

60
00:07:17,945 --> 00:07:20,075
These are the front footprints.

61
00:07:22,065 --> 00:07:24,255
They are deeper.

62
00:07:24,435 --> 00:07:28,435
The horse's head is in front, that's
why it's heavy, you idiot.

63
00:07:28,995 --> 00:07:32,045
Osman must have turned
the horseshoes!

64
00:07:36,035 --> 00:07:37,845
Bring the poison arrows.

65
00:07:42,405 --> 00:07:44,055
We will split to two parts.

66
00:07:44,075 --> 00:07:46,635
You will go in the direction
indicated by the traces.

67
00:07:46,665 --> 00:07:48,485
The rest will come with me.

68
00:07:49,075 --> 00:07:52,105
You will kill Osman and Mesut
wherever you see them.

69
00:08:03,635 --> 00:08:06,905
Hadrat Sultan, we make you walk
like this without a horse.

70
00:08:06,925 --> 00:08:08,385
Sorry.

71
00:08:09,395 --> 00:08:12,255
I will decide on this when I
ascend the throne, Osman Bey.

72
00:08:12,665 --> 00:08:15,175
I don't judge now, anyway.

73
00:08:16,015 --> 00:08:19,255
We couldn't have gone where we were
going with the Mongols following us.

74
00:08:19,275 --> 00:08:21,775
For this reason, bear a little.

75
00:08:22,085 --> 00:08:23,385
Good.

76
00:08:25,385 --> 00:08:26,925
Osman Bey.

77
00:08:29,505 --> 00:08:32,005
I want you to answer me honestly.

78
00:08:32,775 --> 00:08:34,554
I've known you for years.

79
00:08:34,975 --> 00:08:36,515
Let's say you succeeded...

80
00:08:36,544 --> 00:08:38,325
and made me ascend the throne.

81
00:08:39,225 --> 00:08:41,095
What will you ask from me?

82
00:08:45,425 --> 00:08:47,965
When you ascend the
throne of the East...

83
00:08:49,405 --> 00:08:51,855
the gates of the West will
be opened to me.

84
00:08:52,315 --> 00:08:54,405
You will support me in conquests.

85
00:08:55,945 --> 00:08:57,955
But these things will
happen in the future.

86
00:08:57,985 --> 00:08:59,865
If we talk about the current situation...

87
00:09:02,615 --> 00:09:04,435
your presence...

88
00:09:06,005 --> 00:09:08,105
will weaken the power of
the Sultan Mother.

89
00:09:10,165 --> 00:09:12,255
Everything that happens is because of her.

90
00:09:13,005 --> 00:09:16,005
Her greed for power made
my nephew hostile to me.

91
00:09:16,615 --> 00:09:18,645
She took my throne from me.

92
00:09:19,675 --> 00:09:22,465
What did she take
from you, Osman Bey?

93
00:09:24,035 --> 00:09:25,415
My castles...

94
00:09:26,745 --> 00:09:28,085
and...

95
00:09:29,585 --> 00:09:31,405
she gave them to the infidels.

96
00:09:31,655 --> 00:09:37,695
I will take my properties
back and cut off her head.

97
00:09:40,245 --> 00:09:43,835
You'll take it, I promise.

98
00:09:46,015 --> 00:09:48,905
When I ascend the throne, I will
stand behind you.

99
00:09:49,715 --> 00:09:54,225
You will recover many times
what you lost, Osman Bey.

100
00:10:02,455 --> 00:10:03,985
My Sultan!

101
00:10:04,025 --> 00:10:05,525
Alps!

102
00:10:07,055 --> 00:10:09,145
My Sultan, hold on.

103
00:10:09,275 --> 00:10:11,365
Hold on.

104
00:10:20,315 --> 00:10:21,635
You are...

105
00:10:24,715 --> 00:10:26,095
You are...

106
00:10:27,825 --> 00:10:29,415
Come on, Alps.

107
00:10:29,455 --> 00:10:32,375
Everyone will take their provisions.

108
00:10:36,245 --> 00:10:37,765
Bala Hatun...

109
00:10:38,755 --> 00:10:41,535
it's good that we survived the day, but...

110
00:10:41,685 --> 00:10:43,665
What are we going to
do tomorrow?

111
00:10:44,605 --> 00:10:46,835
We must find a way, Bengi Hatun.

112
00:10:47,385 --> 00:10:48,785
Do not worry.

113
00:10:49,535 --> 00:10:50,835
How do I not worry?

114
00:10:51,195 --> 00:10:53,195
This is not only your problem.

115
00:10:53,225 --> 00:10:55,395
I also want to do the best I can.

116
00:10:57,135 --> 00:11:01,425
If you wish, give us one of the carriers and
let us distribute to the neighboring tribes.

117
00:11:03,325 --> 00:11:05,335
Yes, Bala Hatun.

118
00:11:06,355 --> 00:11:08,185
Let's do something.

119
00:11:10,245 --> 00:11:11,835
Okay.

120
00:11:12,165 --> 00:11:13,465
Good.

121
00:11:15,215 --> 00:11:17,215
Distribute the supplies quickly.

122
00:11:17,235 --> 00:11:19,265
We must dispel the fear of the people.

123
00:11:26,915 --> 00:11:30,615
Having you by our side has made
me very happy, Bengi Hatun.

124
00:11:32,745 --> 00:11:36,235
Our rivalry remains between us.

125
00:11:36,425 --> 00:11:38,275
But this is a different matter.

126
00:11:40,205 --> 00:11:41,745
Gürbüz Alp.

127
00:11:43,105 --> 00:11:45,845
Hand that carriage over to Bengi Hatun.

128
00:11:47,135 --> 00:11:48,735
It will be distributed to
neighboring tribes.

129
00:11:48,755 --> 00:11:49,805
Not possible.

130
00:11:53,465 --> 00:11:55,305
We'll take the supplies.

131
00:11:58,095 --> 00:12:00,905
I no longer have
confidence in Bengi Hatun.

132
00:12:01,765 --> 00:12:03,975
What's that talk, Malhun Hatun?

133
00:12:04,155 --> 00:12:06,365
We are all doing our best for the people.

134
00:12:07,955 --> 00:12:10,445
I say I will forget what
you did to me and help you.

135
00:12:10,475 --> 00:12:12,155
Look what you say.

136
00:12:12,285 --> 00:12:15,495
Have you forgotten who you were standing
behind a while ago, Bengi Hatun?

137
00:12:18,925 --> 00:12:20,495
Cerkutay.

138
00:12:21,865 --> 00:12:23,755
We'll take the cart. (carriage)

139
00:12:25,055 --> 00:12:26,645
Gürbüz.

140
00:12:27,795 --> 00:12:29,855
Give me the cart.

141
00:12:30,935 --> 00:12:32,945
Stop it, Gürbüz.

142
00:12:34,805 --> 00:12:38,075
- Right away, Gürbüz.
- I told you to stop, Gürbüz.

143
00:12:58,115 --> 00:12:59,525
I came, Osman.

144
00:13:00,295 --> 00:13:04,505
Samagar, whom you put in prison,
will make this world your prison.

145
00:13:04,855 --> 00:13:06,085
You shouldn't have come.

146
00:13:06,865 --> 00:13:08,755
I'd come to you, anyway.

147
00:13:09,745 --> 00:13:11,495
You will be my revenge.

148
00:13:12,005 --> 00:13:14,155
As for my job, it's to get Mesut's head.

149
00:13:14,855 --> 00:13:19,315
Give it to me so that I may kill
you without skinning you.

150
00:13:20,295 --> 00:13:22,915
We never turn away from
those who turn to us

151
00:13:23,325 --> 00:13:24,625
Never.

152
00:13:25,955 --> 00:13:27,975
I know how to take him, Osman.

153
00:13:29,375 --> 00:13:32,235
Come on, come on, let's see.

154
00:13:48,065 --> 00:13:49,815
Hadrat Sultan, be patient.

155
00:13:50,205 --> 00:13:52,485
You will live, you will live.

156
00:13:52,715 --> 00:13:54,855
Alps!

157
00:13:55,285 --> 00:13:57,785
I am going with the
Sultan, please, protect us.

158
00:13:59,445 --> 00:14:01,535
Don't let any them attack us.

159
00:14:01,655 --> 00:14:04,375
- We'll get out of here alive.
- Thank you, my Bey.

160
00:14:06,415 --> 00:14:07,495
- Baysungur.
- My Bey.

161
00:14:07,525 --> 00:14:09,385
- Protect us.
- My Sultan.

162
00:14:10,805 --> 00:14:12,155
Attack!

163
00:14:12,235 --> 00:14:15,945
If Mesut and Osman run
away, I will kill you all.

164
00:14:22,085 --> 00:14:25,105
Not possible, Bala, I never
trust this woman

165
00:14:25,455 --> 00:14:26,935
We can't hand her the supplies.

166
00:14:27,065 --> 00:14:30,115
Acting like this won't help.

167
00:14:30,595 --> 00:14:32,905
- If we don't trust her now...
- I said no, Bala.

168
00:14:32,935 --> 00:14:36,135
I've said my final word, we're the
ones to ride the cart

169
00:14:36,295 --> 00:14:38,855
I didn't say my final word, Malhun.

170
00:14:46,825 --> 00:14:48,985
Since yesterday, you've changed
a lot, Bala Hatun.

171
00:14:50,445 --> 00:14:53,925
What did Sultan Mother promise you
so that you started talking loudly?

172
00:14:55,535 --> 00:14:58,075
My voice was
always very loud, Malhun Hatun.

173
00:14:58,095 --> 00:15:00,125
You're the one pretending not to hear it.

174
00:15:00,225 --> 00:15:03,475
Weigh the words you say, or I'm
going to start something.

175
00:15:03,825 --> 00:15:05,575
Nothing stops you.

176
00:15:25,485 --> 00:15:28,255
Is this how you carry out
your mission, Frigg?

177
00:15:30,075 --> 00:15:32,605
How did Malhun get access to
those supplies?

178
00:15:33,255 --> 00:15:35,605
Why did I put you there?

179
00:15:36,105 --> 00:15:38,615
I will learn it, don't worry.

180
00:15:39,325 --> 00:15:41,135
Sultan Mother.

181
00:15:42,365 --> 00:15:44,255
She says she will learn that.

182
00:15:44,935 --> 00:15:47,435
The ladies have turned my move
into nothingness!

183
00:15:49,195 --> 00:15:50,695
Nothingness.

184
00:15:55,125 --> 00:15:57,625
I don't want any mistakes, Frigg.

185
00:15:58,665 --> 00:16:00,675
I promise you, Sultan Mother.

186
00:16:02,135 --> 00:16:03,905
I will correct this
mistake.

187
00:16:04,445 --> 00:16:06,155
You will fix it, of course.

188
00:16:07,595 --> 00:16:10,665
Otherwise, there will be no such
thing as an agreement.

189
00:16:15,355 --> 00:16:17,495
No convoy will reach Yenişehir.

190
00:16:18,625 --> 00:16:21,395
You will destroy all the goods you find.

191
00:16:36,475 --> 00:16:38,175
Sultan Mother.

192
00:16:41,285 --> 00:16:44,995
Not being able to take
supplies isn't the end.

193
00:16:48,165 --> 00:16:53,455
The supplies will be the end of them.

194
00:17:01,295 --> 00:17:03,145
What's going on in your mind?

195
00:17:10,295 --> 00:17:12,095
Leave it, Bala Hatun.

196
00:17:12,765 --> 00:17:16,315
Malhun Hatun thinks of herself
as the protector of all people.

197
00:17:16,505 --> 00:17:18,845
She can't hear us anymore.

198
00:17:22,085 --> 00:17:23,454
Gürbüz Alp.

199
00:17:23,505 --> 00:17:26,305
Take the carriage to Bengi Hatun, and
that's my last word.

200
00:17:26,425 --> 00:17:28,425
I'm the one who will deliver this cart.

201
00:17:29,015 --> 00:17:30,735
This is my last word!

202
00:17:36,565 --> 00:17:38,075
Cerkutay, come on!

203
00:17:51,035 --> 00:17:52,365
Then...

204
00:18:04,495 --> 00:18:07,005
- Bala.
- Don't, Ayşe.

205
00:18:09,665 --> 00:18:11,745
Don't ever utter a single word.

206
00:18:12,245 --> 00:18:15,085
I can't come to the tribe
angry like that.

207
00:18:15,385 --> 00:18:17,115
I will go to the khanqah.

208
00:18:44,385 --> 00:18:46,125
What is happening?

209
00:18:47,555 --> 00:18:49,885
Don't you! We promised our Bey.

210
00:18:50,055 --> 00:18:51,545
We'll pull back.

211
00:18:51,765 --> 00:18:53,325
Well, brother.

212
00:18:54,185 --> 00:18:56,215
What promise did you make to your Bey?

213
00:18:56,505 --> 00:19:00,555
If your promise to your master is that
you won't die, you won't keep your promise.

214
00:19:00,945 --> 00:19:04,655
My Bey said "Don't come before you
have brought Samagar's head."

215
00:19:05,665 --> 00:19:07,345
Your Bey has left you behind.

216
00:19:08,535 --> 00:19:09,825
This is war.

217
00:19:10,705 --> 00:19:14,345
The adults flee and
the young become bait.

218
00:19:14,515 --> 00:19:15,885
Come on, you dog.

219
00:19:16,205 --> 00:19:17,085
Come on, come on.

220
00:19:17,185 --> 00:19:19,475
You are Samagar's prey today.

221
00:19:24,715 --> 00:19:26,865
I will not leave any of my Alps
behind.

222
00:19:32,095 --> 00:19:33,285
Be patient, my Sultan.

223
00:19:34,865 --> 00:19:36,235
Alps, back off.

224
00:19:39,875 --> 00:19:41,965
How long will you stay on the run, Osman?

225
00:19:42,135 --> 00:19:43,985
Do you want your time to come?

226
00:19:44,115 --> 00:19:45,665
Come to me, I'm here.

227
00:19:45,805 --> 00:19:47,145
Attack!

228
00:20:05,375 --> 00:20:08,945
Allah is great!

229
00:20:22,285 --> 00:20:25,385
My Bey, we have aimed all our arrows at
them and they still come!

230
00:20:25,435 --> 00:20:28,385
We'll stop here and meet in the cave,
which is in the region of Guragac.

231
00:20:28,445 --> 00:20:29,825
The Sultan will be with me.

232
00:20:29,825 --> 00:20:31,685
Come on, let's go.

233
00:20:35,155 --> 00:20:37,155
Quick, quick, get the horses.

234
00:20:37,475 --> 00:20:39,965
Spread out in all four
directions, look everywhere.

235
00:20:40,085 --> 00:20:43,245
Osman and Mesut
will be found before sunset.

236
00:20:48,455 --> 00:20:49,555
When Mother Sultan...

237
00:20:51,075 --> 00:20:54,405
made me and Olof sit at the same table...

238
00:20:57,225 --> 00:20:59,295
then I drew my path alone, my Sheikh.

239
00:21:02,695 --> 00:21:05,055
However, the matter of
Osman Bey is different.

240
00:21:06,535 --> 00:21:08,105
Its pain is in my heart.

241
00:21:09,755 --> 00:21:12,285
These are the reasons
why I am walking alone.

242
00:21:14,565 --> 00:21:17,625
A Muslim cannot walk alone, Turgut Bey.

243
00:21:19,055 --> 00:21:20,585
He unites...

244
00:21:21,415 --> 00:21:24,395
under the banner of the Muhammad.

245
00:21:25,795 --> 00:21:30,115
As for those who fall into heedlessness
and throw themselves...

246
00:21:30,865 --> 00:21:32,835
in a different way
lose their way.

247
00:21:34,345 --> 00:21:36,975
In the era of happiness (the era when
Muhammad was alive, in Islam)

248
00:21:37,035 --> 00:21:38,795
one of the heathens...

249
00:21:38,965 --> 00:21:46,855
attempted to cause a mess between the
Muhajireen and the Ansar.

250
00:21:48,785 --> 00:21:53,525
The number of Muhajireens wasn't
many, but now their number has increased.

251
00:21:54,315 --> 00:21:56,205
They became more than us.

252
00:21:56,495 --> 00:21:59,845
They are trying to control us.

253
00:22:01,435 --> 00:22:03,285
When we returned to Medina...

254
00:22:03,475 --> 00:22:07,535
the owners of the land and
the royals united...

255
00:22:08,285 --> 00:22:11,985
and they said they will expel Muhajireens.

256
00:22:14,585 --> 00:22:19,375
When the words of this man
reached Muhammad...

257
00:22:19,835 --> 00:22:21,895
Umar was also there.

258
00:22:23,385 --> 00:22:29,945
He said "Allow me to strike the
neck of this infidel."

259
00:22:30,405 --> 00:22:32,945
He asked permission from Muhammad.

260
00:22:34,245 --> 00:22:38,255
He wanted to pay the penalty for
this hypocrite who spreads sedition.

261
00:22:39,645 --> 00:22:41,005
However...

262
00:22:41,765 --> 00:22:47,285
The Messenger of Allah objected to
the request of Umar.

263
00:22:48,425 --> 00:22:49,975
Leave it, Umar, he said.

264
00:22:50,445 --> 00:22:57,315
"I don't want people to think that
Muhammad kills his friends."

265
00:22:59,175 --> 00:23:03,235
The Messenger of Allah acted
cautious...

266
00:23:03,995 --> 00:23:06,995
so that...

267
00:23:07,375 --> 00:23:10,965
heathens wouldn't reach their goals.

268
00:23:13,245 --> 00:23:20,065
Osman Bey accepted the offer of
Sultan Mother and gave her the castles...

269
00:23:20,555 --> 00:23:23,765
he acted with serenity.

270
00:23:25,295 --> 00:23:28,925
However, the time has come.

271
00:23:29,955 --> 00:23:34,725
Now, we need the wrath of our Umar.

272
00:23:38,735 --> 00:23:40,535
Do you have this anger...

273
00:23:41,545 --> 00:23:43,085
Turgut Bey?

274
00:23:43,375 --> 00:23:45,245
Do you have the anger...

275
00:23:46,085 --> 00:23:50,155
that boils over for the cause?

276
00:23:52,485 --> 00:23:55,325
For the cause of upholding
the word of Allah...

277
00:23:56,185 --> 00:23:58,725
Will you be able to control yourself...

278
00:23:59,405 --> 00:24:00,935
Turgut Bey?

279
00:24:07,385 --> 00:24:10,135
In The Name of Allah, most
gracious, most merciful.

280
00:24:17,675 --> 00:24:22,685
Will you be able to root out the infidels
from the fortress of the Turkmens, Turgut Bey?

281
00:24:26,405 --> 00:24:28,295
Think about this very carefully.

282
00:24:50,005 --> 00:24:52,015
Hey, hey!

283
00:24:53,055 --> 00:24:55,645
Come on, bear it, bear it, bear
it, brother.

284
00:24:55,895 --> 00:24:57,025
Şamil.

285
00:24:57,245 --> 00:24:59,095
Lie down, my Sultan.

286
00:24:59,955 --> 00:25:01,815
- Give us water.
- Here, my Bey.

287
00:25:02,425 --> 00:25:03,925
My Sultan.

288
00:25:06,015 --> 00:25:07,725
Come on.

289
00:25:14,645 --> 00:25:15,925
Sultan.

290
00:25:15,955 --> 00:25:19,205
Sultan is not someone who
falls like this because of one arrow.

291
00:25:20,335 --> 00:25:22,865
My Bey, are you saying the
arrow might be poisoned?

292
00:25:22,905 --> 00:25:24,785
Let's open the wound and let's see.

293
00:25:32,425 --> 00:25:33,955
Brothers.

294
00:25:34,385 --> 00:25:36,395
Sultan isn't good.

295
00:25:36,745 --> 00:25:38,505
I don't want to say that, however...

296
00:25:38,575 --> 00:25:41,405
If Sultan dies, what will we do then?

297
00:25:42,155 --> 00:25:43,955
May Allah forbid, my brother.

298
00:25:44,405 --> 00:25:46,485
My Bey worked hard for his moves.

299
00:25:47,115 --> 00:25:48,855
He must live.

300
00:25:50,515 --> 00:25:52,075
In the name of Allah.

301
00:25:52,235 --> 00:25:53,795
In the name of Allah.

302
00:26:10,105 --> 00:26:11,815
His breath is not good.

303
00:26:17,945 --> 00:26:19,495
My Sultan.

304
00:26:20,395 --> 00:26:24,455
My Sultan!

305
00:26:25,215 --> 00:26:27,755
Aykurt! Tell my Sheikh at once!

306
00:26:27,815 --> 00:26:29,165
Your command, my Bey.

307
00:26:29,185 --> 00:26:30,215
Come on.

308
00:26:30,255 --> 00:26:33,785
My Sultan!

309
00:26:34,085 --> 00:26:36,455
No! No!

310
00:26:42,335 --> 00:26:43,725
No!

311
00:27:11,655 --> 00:27:13,175
Osman.

312
00:27:13,985 --> 00:27:15,565
Osman!

313
00:27:18,345 --> 00:27:20,865
How dare you kidnap Mesut?

314
00:27:22,725 --> 00:27:24,785
You've crossed your limit this time.

315
00:27:25,515 --> 00:27:28,345
You've gone too far.

316
00:27:53,585 --> 00:27:56,185
I'm listening to you, Bengi Hatun.

317
00:27:58,795 --> 00:28:02,315
Today I offered a little
help to Bala Hatun.

318
00:28:03,185 --> 00:28:05,585
Malhun Hatun disagreed.

319
00:28:06,515 --> 00:28:10,665
It's clear that Bala won't make
way for Malhun anymore.

320
00:28:12,195 --> 00:28:13,695
You are a smart Hatun.

321
00:28:16,385 --> 00:28:19,745
But apparently, Bala is also smart.

322
00:28:22,415 --> 00:28:26,495
She listened to what I said.

323
00:28:28,025 --> 00:28:29,555
She did.

324
00:28:29,765 --> 00:28:32,275
She is now coming to the
khanqah to see her father.

325
00:28:32,695 --> 00:28:36,275
I wanted to go ahead and
give you this good news.

326
00:28:40,225 --> 00:28:43,035
Not only that, Sultan Mother.

327
00:28:45,175 --> 00:28:49,175
Whatever is talked about in Osman's
palace from now on, we will hear it too.

328
00:28:49,845 --> 00:28:53,635
Alçiçek's helper Esma is now
in the Yenişehir palace.

329
00:28:55,155 --> 00:28:56,905
Very nice.

330
00:28:58,805 --> 00:29:00,585
Very nice.

331
00:29:03,585 --> 00:29:06,835
Tell Esma to wait for news from me.

332
00:29:09,515 --> 00:29:12,045
You say we will flare up
the fire more.

333
00:29:15,495 --> 00:29:19,815
We will...

334
00:29:23,595 --> 00:29:32,155
so that this fire will turn all of
Osman's dreams into ashes.

335
00:29:38,035 --> 00:29:39,585
Let's heal this wound.

336
00:29:42,435 --> 00:29:46,005
Come on, in the name of Allah!

337
00:29:47,225 --> 00:29:48,755
Come on!

338
00:29:49,075 --> 00:29:51,575
My Sultan.

339
00:29:52,865 --> 00:29:54,575
My Sultan!

340
00:29:56,025 --> 00:29:57,915
Şamil, look at this.

341
00:29:58,235 --> 00:30:02,785
His eyes are completely red, while
their surroundings are yellow.

342
00:30:05,385 --> 00:30:07,935
Don't you know about this poison?
Don't you know?

343
00:30:08,115 --> 00:30:10,155
I'll find out, my Bey.

344
00:30:25,595 --> 00:30:28,175
My Bey, this is scorpion poison.

345
00:30:28,645 --> 00:30:30,485
I know the herb that will heal it.

346
00:30:30,555 --> 00:30:33,095
It rarely grows in this
area, but I will find it.

347
00:30:33,755 --> 00:30:35,265
Why are you waiting?

348
00:30:35,335 --> 00:30:37,375
Don't come back before you find that herb.

349
00:30:37,445 --> 00:30:42,535
Şamil, if you don't find it, we will lose
Sultan.

350
00:30:48,275 --> 00:30:50,825
Hold on.

351
00:30:51,325 --> 00:30:53,635
Söğüt

352
00:31:11,985 --> 00:31:13,535
Bala Hatun.

353
00:31:16,345 --> 00:31:18,175
Sultan Mother.

354
00:31:19,385 --> 00:31:21,435
Would you have gone without seeing me?

355
00:31:25,785 --> 00:31:27,515
Stop, let me look at you.

356
00:31:30,055 --> 00:31:33,095
What made you angry?

357
00:31:35,545 --> 00:31:38,395
Only my Sheikh can
calm the anger inside me...

358
00:31:38,915 --> 00:31:40,785
I wanted to go there first.

359
00:31:40,825 --> 00:31:43,615
I'd see you by later, of course.

360
00:31:46,545 --> 00:31:50,545
Even I'm not at Sheikh Edebalı's
level, I'm also a good listener.

361
00:31:51,495 --> 00:31:53,345
Tell me, what's your problem?

362
00:31:55,065 --> 00:31:56,605
You were right.

363
00:31:59,215 --> 00:32:01,765
I thought everyone was like me.

364
00:32:03,065 --> 00:32:04,885
Is it Malhun Hatun?

365
00:32:08,355 --> 00:32:12,435
She ignored my words
today in front of everyone.

366
00:32:13,415 --> 00:32:15,195
I will not forgive her for this.

367
00:32:18,475 --> 00:32:22,335
She raises her voice to
suppress your voice.

368
00:32:24,225 --> 00:32:26,935
But you must not take any step back.

369
00:32:29,355 --> 00:32:33,355
I will invite all the Hatuns of the
tribesmen to the Inn tomorrow.

370
00:32:34,645 --> 00:32:36,355
You should come too.

371
00:32:36,565 --> 00:32:42,565
Come, too, so they can see
who the Head Hatun of Yenişehir is.

372
00:32:55,245 --> 00:32:56,775
Will it be useful?

373
00:32:56,855 --> 00:33:00,635
He will open his eyes immediately, and
his wound will heal quickly, my Bey.

374
00:33:11,505 --> 00:33:13,055
My Allah.

375
00:33:16,985 --> 00:33:19,055
My Bey, he should drink this.

376
00:33:19,425 --> 00:33:21,175
Help me, Baysungur.

377
00:33:28,265 --> 00:33:30,075
Take it, it's done.

378
00:33:30,855 --> 00:33:32,695
Slowly, slowly.

379
00:33:40,395 --> 00:33:42,415
It shows its effect, doesn't it, my Bey?

380
00:33:44,665 --> 00:33:47,455
His breath is getting
better little by little.

381
00:33:48,445 --> 00:33:49,745
Praise be to Allah.

382
00:33:49,845 --> 00:33:52,565
Thank Allah!

383
00:33:56,215 --> 00:33:57,795
My Sultan.

384
00:33:59,015 --> 00:34:00,565
Breathe.

385
00:34:01,595 --> 00:34:03,295
Breathe deeply.

386
00:34:06,385 --> 00:34:08,105
Are you okay now?

387
00:34:08,495 --> 00:34:11,565
We had better days, Osman Bey.

388
00:34:16,014 --> 00:34:17,514
Thank you, Şamil.

389
00:34:17,594 --> 00:34:19,135
Thank you, my Bey.

390
00:34:20,965 --> 00:34:22,695
Mashallah.

391
00:34:23,165 --> 00:34:24,665
Hadrat Sultan.

392
00:34:24,745 --> 00:34:29,925
Don't worry, we will take you to a safer
place than here and right away.

393
00:34:30,625 --> 00:34:36,705
The one who did this to you is
the Mother Sultan herself.

394
00:34:38,074 --> 00:34:39,195
You should know this.

395
00:34:39,935 --> 00:34:43,735
I know, I know, Osman Bey.

396
00:34:44,614 --> 00:34:46,495
Samagar trusts her.

397
00:34:46,864 --> 00:34:48,875
Saveli too.

398
00:34:49,975 --> 00:34:54,565
If they did not exist, then the
Sultan Mother would have no power.

399
00:34:54,864 --> 00:34:56,735
I will destroy them all.

400
00:35:00,305 --> 00:35:01,855
Tell me now...

401
00:35:03,895 --> 00:35:06,645
How can I destroy the power
of the Sultan Mother?

402
00:35:07,665 --> 00:35:09,215
How?

403
00:35:10,265 --> 00:35:12,405
There is a seal, Osman Bey.

404
00:35:13,075 --> 00:35:17,075
She has her full power from that seal.

405
00:35:24,385 --> 00:35:25,735
Seal?

406
00:35:27,375 --> 00:35:28,695
How?

407
00:35:30,335 --> 00:35:32,145
If I take that seal...

408
00:35:33,075 --> 00:35:36,155
can I stop her?

409
00:35:37,835 --> 00:35:39,645
If the seal is not present...

410
00:35:40,915 --> 00:35:43,475
She will no longer have any power.

411
00:35:46,025 --> 00:35:48,115
Mother Sultan!

412
00:36:21,940 --> 00:36:24,480
Traitor, traitor!

413
00:36:27,740 --> 00:36:30,770
I will cut off Turgut's head
with my own hands!

414
00:36:31,630 --> 00:36:35,720
When Sultan Mother learns that
he is the one who took the supplies...

415
00:36:35,870 --> 00:36:38,430
Don't, don't, Frody!

416
00:36:38,960 --> 00:36:40,760
You won't say anything to anyone!

417
00:36:41,730 --> 00:36:44,360
You will not say anything
to Sultan Mother!

418
00:36:47,490 --> 00:36:49,930
Will what that traitor did
remain unpunished?

419
00:36:50,290 --> 00:36:52,770
How many of our soldiers
have been killed, Dan?

420
00:36:54,340 --> 00:36:55,970
He will pay for this!

421
00:36:56,010 --> 00:37:00,790
He will! I promise you.

422
00:37:01,420 --> 00:37:03,160
But not now.

423
00:37:03,560 --> 00:37:08,120
When the time comes, we will kill
him with our own hands.

424
00:37:08,320 --> 00:37:10,080
But not now.

425
00:37:10,160 --> 00:37:13,220
When? when?

426
00:37:14,130 --> 00:37:16,680
When? When?

427
00:37:24,210 --> 00:37:25,540
When?

428
00:37:36,705 --> 00:37:40,845
May you belong to who is skilled in war.

429
00:37:42,835 --> 00:37:44,945
How long have you been
dreaming of royalty?

430
00:37:45,185 --> 00:37:48,225
Since the blood of my heroes spilled
on the ground in the conquests years ago.

431
00:37:48,235 --> 00:37:49,805
Isn't Öktem's blood enough?

432
00:37:49,835 --> 00:37:52,235
Whatever it was, you gave possession to
whoever was not present at the conquest.

433
00:37:52,265 --> 00:37:54,165
I've always been by
your side, Osman Bey.

434
00:37:54,185 --> 00:37:57,305
You chose this.

435
00:38:02,465 --> 00:38:06,345
No, this is not
permissible, I cannot bear this.

436
00:38:15,995 --> 00:38:18,675
If you want to expel me from my country...

437
00:38:20,935 --> 00:38:22,935
I will not leave a home to anyone.

438
00:38:32,785 --> 00:38:34,295
Kutan.

439
00:38:37,185 --> 00:38:38,725
Your command, my Bey.

440
00:38:39,355 --> 00:38:45,365
Send messengers to the Beys
of Bilecik, Karacahisar and Kulucahisar.

441
00:38:45,765 --> 00:38:47,255
Let them line up their armies.

442
00:38:47,325 --> 00:38:52,645
I, Turgut, won't leave the kingdom of the
Turks under the shadow of the infidels.

443
00:38:54,235 --> 00:38:55,815
May Allah bless you, my Bey.

444
00:38:55,855 --> 00:38:57,215
Your command.

445
00:38:57,245 --> 00:38:58,585
Come on.

446
00:39:04,625 --> 00:39:07,195
Söğüt

447
00:40:02,585 --> 00:40:04,295
Where is Mesut?

448
00:40:07,035 --> 00:40:10,115
Where could Osman
hide him?

449
00:40:10,895 --> 00:40:12,205
Speak!

450
00:40:15,385 --> 00:40:19,955
If you don't tell me all of
Osman's secret places...

451
00:40:20,535 --> 00:40:23,035
you won't be able to breathe.

452
00:40:24,885 --> 00:40:26,455
Ask your men.

453
00:40:34,425 --> 00:40:38,215
Are you making fun of me?

454
00:41:20,705 --> 00:41:22,285
Are you in pain?

455
00:41:26,265 --> 00:41:28,625
If you don't speak, you will suffer more.

456
00:41:36,515 --> 00:41:38,545
You won't get any word from me.

457
00:41:47,845 --> 00:41:49,235
Summon him.

458
00:41:59,875 --> 00:42:02,215
I will find that seal no matter what.

459
00:42:03,095 --> 00:42:06,605
And I will take everything Sultan
Mother have.

460
00:42:14,285 --> 00:42:15,325
My Sheikh.

461
00:42:15,395 --> 00:42:16,895
Osman Bey.

462
00:42:16,935 --> 00:42:18,315
My Sheikh

463
00:42:18,795 --> 00:42:20,575
Sultan Mesut is fine.

464
00:42:20,665 --> 00:42:22,455
He's fine, don't worry.

465
00:42:25,205 --> 00:42:26,535
Bala.

466
00:42:26,555 --> 00:42:27,565
Are you well?

467
00:42:27,585 --> 00:42:28,775
I'm good.

468
00:42:28,835 --> 00:42:30,405
Mashallah.

469
00:42:31,515 --> 00:42:35,695
May Allah heal you, Sultan Mesut.

470
00:42:39,085 --> 00:42:40,615
Osman Bey.

471
00:42:41,225 --> 00:42:43,075
Dervishes are outside.

472
00:42:43,735 --> 00:42:46,275
Now I know why they are required.

473
00:42:47,035 --> 00:42:49,625
My Sheikh, Söğüt is the safest place.

474
00:42:49,735 --> 00:42:52,295
The most unattractive place is the khanqah.

475
00:42:52,695 --> 00:42:57,395
The dervishes will let Sultan Mesut
inside without anyone seeing him.

476
00:42:59,065 --> 00:43:01,855
Sultana Mother is so arrogant that she...

477
00:43:02,065 --> 00:43:04,125
will not see what is in front of her eyes.

478
00:43:04,625 --> 00:43:06,495
She won't come to the khanqah.

479
00:43:07,585 --> 00:43:09,425
Good thing you thought of it.

480
00:43:10,755 --> 00:43:15,575
We are pleased to host you in our
humble place, Sultan Mesut.

481
00:43:15,885 --> 00:43:19,475
But if you are looking for the comfort you
used to feel in the palace...

482
00:43:19,525 --> 00:43:21,245
You will not be able to find it.

483
00:43:21,385 --> 00:43:24,465
Our bed is made of goatskin.

484
00:43:24,575 --> 00:43:26,575
Be aware of this.

485
00:43:28,145 --> 00:43:30,865
It's fine, Sheikh Edebalı.

486
00:43:32,305 --> 00:43:35,905
Your goatskin bed...

487
00:43:36,755 --> 00:43:40,995
is better than those in the palace.

488
00:43:43,315 --> 00:43:47,605
At least my life is in good hands.

489
00:43:47,865 --> 00:43:49,175
Thank you.

490
00:43:51,305 --> 00:43:53,165
Bala will solve this.

491
00:43:54,355 --> 00:43:57,225
We will destroy Sultan Mother.

492
00:43:58,705 --> 00:44:00,205
Osman Bey.

493
00:44:00,825 --> 00:44:06,435
Are you talking about getting to İsmihan
and taking the seal from her?

494
00:44:06,495 --> 00:44:08,495
Don't worry at all.

495
00:44:09,165 --> 00:44:11,045
Bala will deal with it...

496
00:44:11,895 --> 00:44:13,745
without making her feel anything

497
00:44:15,505 --> 00:44:18,025
Don't worry, Sultan Mesut.

498
00:44:18,675 --> 00:44:21,255
Come on, we have to go
without wasting time.

499
00:44:21,275 --> 00:44:25,605
I leave you in the safety of Allah first and
then in the trust of those I trust the most.

500
00:44:28,565 --> 00:44:30,085
Osman Bey.

501
00:44:30,725 --> 00:44:32,505
Where are you going?

502
00:44:34,545 --> 00:44:37,055
I had told you that I would
cut off two heads.

503
00:44:38,645 --> 00:44:41,175
And now I'm going to cut
the first of them.

504
00:44:48,355 --> 00:44:49,705
My Sheikh.

505
00:44:51,375 --> 00:44:52,955
Bala.

506
00:45:03,085 --> 00:45:05,635
Come on, Frigg

507
00:45:21,715 --> 00:45:23,565
But he thinks you're Marta.

508
00:45:27,165 --> 00:45:28,735
Obviously...

509
00:45:28,795 --> 00:45:32,385
He will die with this
information, Sultan Mother.

510
00:45:36,975 --> 00:45:38,795
But this information...

511
00:45:39,055 --> 00:45:41,405
won't help him at all.

512
00:45:47,645 --> 00:45:49,185
But your actions...

513
00:45:51,615 --> 00:45:54,655
will be enough to make him talk.

514
00:46:02,125 --> 00:46:03,695
What is that?

515
00:46:11,855 --> 00:46:13,385
Is it...

516
00:46:14,735 --> 00:46:21,295
insects that will make all of
Yenişehir's supplies toxic?

517
00:46:22,605 --> 00:46:24,195
You damned people.

518
00:46:29,195 --> 00:46:30,785
Look, look.

519
00:46:30,855 --> 00:46:32,165
Look, my Sultan.

520
00:46:32,195 --> 00:46:34,435
He's already started talking.

521
00:46:39,825 --> 00:46:41,915
I think we should try it here first.

522
00:46:43,595 --> 00:46:50,135
Let's see if it has the
power to make Osman's Alp talk.

523
00:47:56,955 --> 00:47:59,475
İnegöl Castle

524
00:47:59,940 --> 00:48:02,610
We did business with you
once, Turgut Bey, that's right.

525
00:48:02,620 --> 00:48:04,620
But why do you keep bringing us together?

526
00:48:04,740 --> 00:48:08,270
Did it end
like this, Uraz Bey?

527
00:48:08,890 --> 00:48:11,420
Is everything completed?

528
00:48:11,880 --> 00:48:14,890
What is not done yet, Turgut Bey? Tell us.

529
00:48:14,930 --> 00:48:17,020
We did not get our castles.

530
00:48:17,100 --> 00:48:19,270
We did not clean the
lands from the infidels.

531
00:48:19,300 --> 00:48:21,190
We didn't do anything.

532
00:48:21,300 --> 00:48:23,300
Don't, Turgut Bey.

533
00:48:23,690 --> 00:48:27,450
When the infidels were in the castles,
we were the ones who confronted them.

534
00:48:27,830 --> 00:48:33,310
You were sharing your food with
the infidels then.

535
00:48:33,560 --> 00:48:37,980
Also, did you not keep silent, Turgut Bey?

536
00:48:38,090 --> 00:48:40,830
You keep repeating the same thing.

537
00:48:42,410 --> 00:48:45,000
That food was poison to me.

538
00:48:45,720 --> 00:48:47,730
Specifically for me.

539
00:48:51,220 --> 00:48:53,090
Now, tell me.

540
00:48:54,260 --> 00:48:56,850
While we are working for our lands...

541
00:48:58,060 --> 00:48:59,850
Where is Osman Bey?

542
00:48:59,930 --> 00:49:01,300
Tell me.

543
00:49:02,330 --> 00:49:04,200
Where is Öktem Bey?

544
00:49:04,200 --> 00:49:07,450
Is there anyone pursuing
this cause but me? Tell me.

545
00:49:11,510 --> 00:49:15,640
If the issue is the conquest, then our
souls are sacrificed on this path.

546
00:49:16,550 --> 00:49:18,380
Tell us what we'll do.

547
00:49:20,310 --> 00:49:21,900
May Allah bless you.

548
00:49:22,100 --> 00:49:23,480
First...

549
00:49:23,660 --> 00:49:26,410
We will strike the necks of the infidels
who are in the castles...

550
00:49:26,710 --> 00:49:29,990
and we clean them from
our lands forever, Inshallah.

551
00:49:31,460 --> 00:49:35,290
Olof's dogs see us as too
weak to think of attacking them.

552
00:49:35,700 --> 00:49:39,270
We will defeat them through
this arrogance.

553
00:49:41,500 --> 00:49:43,340
Now listen to me carefully.

554
00:49:44,630 --> 00:49:47,150
My Alps will be stationed
next to the castle.

555
00:49:47,180 --> 00:49:51,760
You will open the gates when
you are sure of the measures.

556
00:49:52,280 --> 00:49:58,340
Then, we will sweep Olof and his dogs
from our homeland, Inshallah.

557
00:50:01,400 --> 00:50:03,380
Now tell me, Beys.

558
00:50:03,780 --> 00:50:05,480
Are you with me?

559
00:50:07,590 --> 00:50:09,590
Beys are with me.

560
00:50:34,540 --> 00:50:37,050
Yenişehir, Osman Bey's Palace

561
00:50:37,285 --> 00:50:40,365
Will Bala Hatun stay in the khanqah?

562
00:50:41,885 --> 00:50:43,925
This is what it looks like, Ülgen

563
00:50:45,255 --> 00:50:47,755
I didn't get it! Why did this happen?

564
00:50:50,525 --> 00:50:52,585
Don't talk about it too much.

565
00:50:53,045 --> 00:50:54,845
Their anger is still fresh, however...

566
00:50:55,275 --> 00:50:59,015
Bengi Hatun wanted to do
something. What's wrong with that?

567
00:50:59,245 --> 00:51:01,295
Perhaps it would have
been fixed like this.

568
00:51:01,325 --> 00:51:03,405
This isn't that big.

569
00:51:03,415 --> 00:51:04,935
Ülgen.

570
00:51:09,465 --> 00:51:11,025
Malhun Hatun.

571
00:51:11,215 --> 00:51:12,575
I...

572
00:51:12,825 --> 00:51:14,765
It's not my problem, however...

573
00:51:14,825 --> 00:51:16,975
I was so sad, so...

574
00:51:17,145 --> 00:51:19,145
Since you were so sad...

575
00:51:19,175 --> 00:51:21,715
you should have gone after Bala.

576
00:51:23,735 --> 00:51:26,705
Gather your things and get
out of here as soon as possible.

577
00:51:31,215 --> 00:51:32,575
But...

578
00:51:34,545 --> 00:51:37,415
Are you kicking me out now?

579
00:51:40,125 --> 00:51:42,195
Stop, Malhun.

580
00:51:45,655 --> 00:51:48,315
If you're going to leave Ülgen
go, but I won't.

581
00:51:48,815 --> 00:51:52,525
I said my last word, Bala.
Ülgen, you're going.

582
00:51:52,705 --> 00:51:54,745
But I haven't said my last word yet.

583
00:51:55,205 --> 00:51:58,065
Let's talk outside then.

584
00:51:58,175 --> 00:51:59,965
Draw your sword and come.

585
00:52:00,025 --> 00:52:03,525
Oh! Don't fight for me!
I'll go!

586
00:52:03,855 --> 00:52:05,675
I will go!

587
00:52:23,295 --> 00:52:25,155
You played so good.

588
00:52:25,335 --> 00:52:28,615
You acted really well
that I believed you too.

589
00:52:29,045 --> 00:52:31,045
You are brilliant.

590
00:52:32,185 --> 00:52:35,005
It's enough if Sultan Mother and Bengi
believe it.

591
00:52:35,155 --> 00:52:38,315
She believed that she was determined
to make this fire so big.

592
00:52:40,595 --> 00:52:45,035
I almost passed out.

593
00:52:46,955 --> 00:52:49,225
Praise be to Allah!
Will you take a look at me?

594
00:52:49,295 --> 00:52:51,365
Is it possible that we
leave you, Ülgen?

595
00:52:51,515 --> 00:52:53,745
You won't leave me, right?

596
00:52:54,145 --> 00:52:56,185
- Calm down!
- I got really scared.

597
00:52:59,755 --> 00:53:01,565
I was confused.

598
00:53:10,415 --> 00:53:14,985
Sultan Mother has sworn to
cause discord between us.

599
00:53:15,345 --> 00:53:17,385
It doesn't look like
she's going to stop.

600
00:53:17,495 --> 00:53:20,165
Then let's deceive her.

601
00:53:20,575 --> 00:53:21,795
Yes, so be it.

602
00:53:23,175 --> 00:53:28,935
Let her think she's done it
until she's relieved and stops.

603
00:53:30,455 --> 00:53:37,165
Fine, but let's do it in a place
that makes everyone believe that game.

604
00:53:48,905 --> 00:53:52,385
She is gathering the Bey's wives tomorrow,
and she has invited me too.

605
00:53:52,475 --> 00:53:54,575
This is the best time to take the seal.

606
00:53:57,185 --> 00:54:00,825
Are we going to be able to take it
out of all those Hatuns?

607
00:54:03,135 --> 00:54:06,405
She must have something
important like that with her.

608
00:54:06,975 --> 00:54:10,085
What if we go to her room at night and
take it while she's asleep?

609
00:54:10,115 --> 00:54:14,185
But I'm not the one who's going in.
Sultan Mother will kill me.

610
00:54:14,855 --> 00:54:18,225
There's no need for this, Ülgen, I know
how we're going to take it.

611
00:54:20,650 --> 00:54:24,150
Your deadline for İnegol has expired.

612
00:54:25,890 --> 00:54:31,440
But I see that Sultan Mother behind
whom you take refuge is not here.

613
00:54:34,860 --> 00:54:36,960
So is your friend Olof.

614
00:54:38,090 --> 00:54:43,520
Don't worry! I will talk to him.

615
00:54:43,820 --> 00:54:47,570
Will you do it
by sitting with him at the same table?

616
00:54:55,950 --> 00:54:58,570
I will charge you for this later.

617
00:55:01,640 --> 00:55:05,770
But now the matter is different.

618
00:55:08,100 --> 00:55:13,890
Mongols who are in Konya are the
biggest supporters of Sultan Mother.

619
00:55:14,840 --> 00:55:17,540
Now they will come to break us.

620
00:55:19,020 --> 00:55:23,540
- We were one...
- Since when we were one?

621
00:55:25,690 --> 00:55:31,260
First, we shall behead
Commander Samagar who will come here.

622
00:55:33,230 --> 00:55:36,280
Then we'll kick Olof
out of the castles.

623
00:55:37,310 --> 00:55:42,030
How are we going to
cut off Samagar's head?

624
00:55:42,980 --> 00:55:44,820
You are the one who will do this.

625
00:55:47,090 --> 00:55:49,880
Standing next to the Sultan
Mother will help you do this.

626
00:55:51,000 --> 00:55:53,010
Tell .

627
00:55:53,600 --> 00:55:59,650
Sultan Mesut is with me.

628
00:56:07,760 --> 00:56:10,350
I knew you wouldn't come
back without anything...

629
00:56:10,900 --> 00:56:12,940
to Sultan Mesut.

630
00:56:16,470 --> 00:56:21,580
Tell Sultan Mother that Sultan Mesut
is in my possession.

631
00:56:22,280 --> 00:56:25,080
I keep him in
the cave at Guragac.

632
00:56:25,430 --> 00:56:27,930
You'll tell her we've taken
action against her.

633
00:56:28,600 --> 00:56:31,070
And she will send us Commander Samagar.

634
00:56:33,370 --> 00:56:37,210
And when he comes to us, I will cut off his head.

635
00:56:38,050 --> 00:56:41,050
Okay.

636
00:56:45,140 --> 00:56:48,960
Get started. There's something
I'm going to talk to him about.

637
00:57:11,400 --> 00:57:15,030
You left me alone in the most
difficult moments I went through.

638
00:57:16,820 --> 00:57:21,410
I lost many martyrs because of you.

639
00:57:22,850 --> 00:57:24,900
Many weapons were lost.

640
00:57:25,670 --> 00:57:28,210
I did not complete many conquests.

641
00:57:37,020 --> 00:57:39,090
And if I'm talking to you now...

642
00:57:40,900 --> 00:57:44,430
This is because my
call is greater than my anger.

643
00:57:47,830 --> 00:57:50,330
The situation for me is
no different from this.

644
00:57:51,550 --> 00:57:55,680
Everything I do is for my calling.

645
00:57:57,630 --> 00:57:59,280
Finish it.

646
00:58:02,210 --> 00:58:04,190
Victory is definitely ours.

647
00:58:06,690 --> 00:58:08,250
You can be sure.

648
00:58:32,140 --> 00:58:35,230
Is Alçiçek okay? Have you ever seen her?

649
00:58:36,150 --> 00:58:38,910
She was so saddened by
what Aktemur Bey did.

650
00:58:40,270 --> 00:58:43,990
But she is strong and knows
how to get up after a fall.

651
00:58:44,200 --> 00:58:47,290
Of course, Alçiçek is a strong girl.

652
00:58:50,240 --> 00:58:57,280
But those who made her fall will
regret it deeply... deeply!

653
00:59:20,170 --> 00:59:29,690
Esma! Did Aktemur call Alçiçek "sister"?

654
00:59:30,610 --> 00:59:35,060
If he had said that, Alçiçek would have
knocked him down immediately.

655
00:59:35,760 --> 00:59:39,330
Right?

656
00:59:40,530 --> 00:59:42,700
That's what they deserve.

657
00:59:44,150 --> 00:59:47,890
Look at the dough and I'll do this.

658
01:00:09,870 --> 01:00:11,620
Why do you look like that?

659
01:00:12,730 --> 01:00:14,990
Am I not allowed to look?

660
01:00:15,470 --> 01:00:19,510
It is forbidden, my brother.
Come on, get out and go on your way

661
01:00:20,330 --> 01:00:23,840
I'm not going out... I'm not going out.

662
01:00:27,300 --> 01:00:31,350
I'm thinking, could this happen?

663
01:00:31,760 --> 01:00:33,300
Why not?

664
01:00:36,400 --> 01:00:41,230
It can't happen... nor should it happen.

665
01:00:41,300 --> 01:00:42,800
No, it can happen.

666
01:00:42,890 --> 01:00:50,090
I told you, it can't happen! Don't
overstep your bounds.

667
01:00:52,260 --> 01:00:58,290
Ülgen Hatun, would you please give
me some food, if possible?

668
01:01:00,050 --> 01:01:04,070
Not Ulgen Hatun!
You'll call her sister Ulgen!

669
01:01:04,740 --> 01:01:06,040
Hatun!

670
01:01:06,120 --> 01:01:10,390
Sister, sister I'm telling you!
Like this: Sister Ulgen! Sister Ulgen!

671
01:01:12,320 --> 01:01:14,080
Do you understand?

672
01:01:17,120 --> 01:01:21,150
That's enough, man! Shut up!
I understand!

673
01:01:23,410 --> 01:01:30,640
But you also should understand this:
You will have no food from me anymore.

674
01:01:30,750 --> 01:01:33,670
Did you understand?
Get out of my kitchen!

675
01:01:38,500 --> 01:01:44,020
- I didn't say it to you.
- Of course you didn't!

676
01:01:46,990 --> 01:01:50,210
- Fill it, fill it.
- I will.

677
01:01:54,150 --> 01:01:55,660
I will enjoy this.

678
01:01:59,800 --> 01:02:03,560
- Fill it up... Fill it up abundantly
- Well, I'll fill it up.

679
01:02:05,690 --> 01:02:07,010
Thank you.

680
01:02:09,500 --> 01:02:11,290
Sogut

681
01:02:14,885 --> 01:02:17,925
I see that you are very disturbed,
Hadrat Mother Sultan.

682
01:02:20,075 --> 01:02:23,565
And this is despite the fact that the
Byzantine commanders support you.

683
01:02:24,235 --> 01:02:26,245
I hope you are not in trouble.

684
01:02:28,235 --> 01:02:31,735
I never lose, Turgut Bey.

685
01:02:33,875 --> 01:02:37,415
And it sounds like you're mad at
me for this Olof issue.

686
01:02:39,665 --> 01:02:44,195
But this is the policy.
Everyone sits together at the same table.

687
01:02:44,525 --> 01:02:48,135
That table was poisonous for me.
I would never sit with him, but...

688
01:02:51,895 --> 01:02:56,835
Anyway... I heard that Osman
took Sultan Mesut from your hand.

689
01:03:00,445 --> 01:03:02,555
Looks like you lost this time.

690
01:03:08,135 --> 01:03:12,705
Osman has ended himself with this move.

691
01:03:16,985 --> 01:03:19,495
Samagar will bring Mesut to me.

692
01:03:19,935 --> 01:03:21,815
He's following Osman now.

693
01:03:22,075 --> 01:03:23,585
Samagar.

694
01:03:23,685 --> 01:03:25,265
Inshallah.

695
01:03:26,405 --> 01:03:30,495
What if I tell you I know where they are?

696
01:03:39,725 --> 01:03:42,245
What does this mean, Turgut Bey?

697
01:03:45,655 --> 01:03:48,385
Do you know it but not telling me?

698
01:03:51,915 --> 01:03:54,695
Or do you want something in return?

699
01:03:57,465 --> 01:04:01,755
Don't you forget that
I protected your castle from Osman.

700
01:04:04,575 --> 01:04:07,615
There are things more valuable than Inegol.

701
01:04:08,475 --> 01:04:14,555
For example, your throne and
your authority...

702
01:04:15,385 --> 01:04:17,965
...and that's why you want Sultan Mesut
so badly.

703
01:04:21,685 --> 01:04:23,275
What do you want?

704
01:04:26,985 --> 01:04:31,485
120 horses and 200 swords
will go to Ingol under your command.

705
01:04:32,795 --> 01:04:34,185
Right now.

706
01:04:35,675 --> 01:04:38,685
Why? Is there a danger?

707
01:04:38,875 --> 01:04:40,885
Danger can come from everywhere.

708
01:04:41,195 --> 01:04:45,695
For example, you might
try to put Olof on Ingol's throne.

709
01:04:46,105 --> 01:04:47,695
Being careful is a good thing.

710
01:04:49,305 --> 01:04:50,835
Avci Bey.

711
01:04:52,095 --> 01:04:56,155
Turgut Bey will be given
120 horses and 200 swords

712
01:04:56,375 --> 01:04:57,675
Immediately.

713
01:05:02,095 --> 01:05:03,465
Eyvallah.(Thank you)

714
01:05:04,605 --> 01:05:06,425
I am listening to you now.

715
01:05:08,525 --> 01:05:11,025
They keep Sultan Mesut
in a cave in Guragac.

716
01:05:11,595 --> 01:05:13,655
But tomorrow they will change location.

717
01:05:13,655 --> 01:05:15,655
You'd better hurry up.

718
01:05:17,325 --> 01:05:18,875
How do you know?

719
01:05:20,295 --> 01:05:23,005
After fighting together all these years...

720
01:05:23,935 --> 01:05:26,125
You know it's not hard for me to know.

721
01:05:28,895 --> 01:05:30,735
First, I heard Mesut.

722
01:05:30,905 --> 01:05:34,475
Then I checked the caves,
and then I saw him with my own eyes.

723
01:05:36,375 --> 01:05:37,965
He was there.

724
01:05:44,185 --> 01:05:45,735
Turgut Bey.

725
01:05:48,375 --> 01:05:50,925
Did you just sell Osman for 120 horses?

726
01:05:52,315 --> 01:05:54,815
Osman is not even worth 5 horses.

727
01:05:55,485 --> 01:05:57,375
I am done with him.

728
01:05:59,575 --> 01:06:03,655
It's all between you and him now.

729
01:06:06,895 --> 01:06:08,415
I should go now.

730
01:06:12,975 --> 01:06:14,515
Goodbye.

731
01:06:24,795 --> 01:06:27,875
Guragac

732
01:06:49,285 --> 01:06:51,815
I will skin whoever moves!

733
01:06:54,295 --> 01:06:56,835
Your end has come, Sultan!

734
01:07:05,475 --> 01:07:07,195
O Right!

735
01:07:10,825 --> 01:07:15,545
I decide what begins and what ends.

736
01:07:22,945 --> 01:07:24,835
I will take your soul, Osman

737
01:07:27,955 --> 01:07:30,025
We don't have a soul to give you.

738
01:07:41,625 --> 01:07:44,125
Sogut

739
01:07:54,855 --> 01:07:57,445
- Peace be upon you.
- Peace be upon you too.

740
01:08:17,465 --> 01:08:21,175
Attention, Mother Sultan coming!

741
01:08:36,354 --> 01:08:38,564
- Welcome.
- Thank you.

742
01:08:40,545 --> 01:08:42,095
Bala Hatun.

743
01:08:44,455 --> 01:08:46,524
Sit where you deserve

744
01:08:58,115 --> 01:08:59,475
Go ahead.

745
01:09:08,215 --> 01:09:12,585
Praise be!
You are all here, Hatuns.

746
01:09:12,725 --> 01:09:15,975
How can we not come when you call,
Hadrat Mother Sultan?

747
01:09:17,845 --> 01:09:21,145
Everyone is here except for Malhun Hatun,
my Sultan.

748
01:09:24,265 --> 01:09:28,595
Bala Hatun, the head of Yenisehir is here.

749
01:09:30,915 --> 01:09:32,865
There is no need for others.

750
01:09:37,555 --> 01:09:38,865
Go ahead.

751
01:09:43,705 --> 01:09:45,705
In The Name of Allah
Most Gracious Most Merciful.

752
01:09:55,525 --> 01:09:57,415
Come to the kitchen.

753
01:10:03,895 --> 01:10:05,775
Since I came here...

754
01:10:06,465 --> 01:10:09,485
...we experienced many things
in a short time.

755
01:10:10,295 --> 01:10:13,075
But there is something I noticed.

756
01:10:14,275 --> 01:10:16,045
Which is the success of The Sisters.

757
01:10:16,425 --> 01:10:19,485
Both in wars and market.

758
01:10:20,135 --> 01:10:25,225
They run from success to success non-stop.

759
01:10:26,245 --> 01:10:29,475
Of course, it's thanks to you, Bala Hatun.

760
01:10:29,655 --> 01:10:32,705
Isn't it, Hatuns?

761
01:10:33,645 --> 01:10:35,175
It certainly is.

762
01:10:35,235 --> 01:10:36,825
Thank you.

763
01:10:37,705 --> 01:10:39,485
The success belongs to...

764
01:10:40,055 --> 01:10:44,855
The Sisters who do not back down
from their goal

765
01:10:46,855 --> 01:10:50,645
- We're just showing them the purpose.
- You're humble.

766
01:10:52,645 --> 01:10:56,405
Everything you touch blossom, Bala Hatun.

767
01:10:56,995 --> 01:11:01,765
From now on, you will take care of
Yenisehir too, not just The Sisters

768
01:11:20,305 --> 01:11:23,305
Come on, sisters,
let's grab the sherbet quickly

769
01:11:23,305 --> 01:11:25,785
Serve Mother Sultan first.

770
01:12:05,685 --> 01:12:07,025
Hey girl!

771
01:12:07,265 --> 01:12:08,625
Stop.

772
01:12:08,685 --> 01:12:12,425
Oh, if you serve it with this,
they'll be mad at me!

773
01:12:13,085 --> 01:12:15,135
Can't you see the dust on it?

774
01:12:18,455 --> 01:12:20,305
Now it shines like a mirror.

775
01:12:21,875 --> 01:12:24,935
We just dodged a scolding.

776
01:13:14,305 --> 01:13:18,855
You're praising The Sisters now,
that's good, but...

777
01:13:19,255 --> 01:13:24,665
...I heard that someone is preventing
his daughters from joining them

778
01:13:28,640 --> 01:13:30,230
Bala Hatun.

779
01:13:30,500 --> 01:13:34,260
I want to join The Sisters if you agree.

780
01:13:36,260 --> 01:13:40,180
First, we have to ask your mother,
Alcicek.

781
01:13:43,800 --> 01:13:45,870
Do you agree, Bengi Hatun?

782
01:13:52,040 --> 01:13:53,840
Of course she can join

783
01:13:57,190 --> 01:14:01,040
I'd be glad that you raise her, Bala.

784
01:14:02,160 --> 01:14:03,470
Eyvallah (thank you).

785
01:14:06,310 --> 01:14:09,620
You have done what is expected of you,
Bengi Hatun.

786
01:14:15,030 --> 01:14:16,540
Hatuns.

787
01:14:20,520 --> 01:14:22,040
You too...

788
01:14:24,210 --> 01:14:27,090
Listen to your Head Hatun.

789
01:14:38,070 --> 01:14:39,940
My Sultan!

790
01:14:40,320 --> 01:14:42,110
Oh Mother Sultan!

791
01:14:42,130 --> 01:14:44,940
Oh Mother Sultan!

792
01:14:44,980 --> 01:14:46,540
Open your eyes, my Sultan!

793
01:14:47,110 --> 01:14:49,660
Close the door quickly,
everyone will be searched!

794
01:14:49,730 --> 01:14:51,780
- Come on
- Open your eyes, Mother Sultan.

795
01:14:53,170 --> 01:14:54,890
Open your eyes, Sultana Mother

796
01:14:54,890 --> 01:14:56,280
Come on.

797
01:14:56,280 --> 01:14:59,100
- Mother Sultan!
- Mother Sultan!

798
01:15:01,190 --> 01:15:03,700
Mother Sultan, open your eyes.

799
01:15:09,030 --> 01:15:10,620
Is she breathing?

800
01:15:11,280 --> 01:15:13,080
- She is.
- We have to make her vomit.

801
01:15:13,190 --> 01:15:15,940
- Come on Bala.
- Turn her around.

802
01:15:22,580 --> 01:15:25,460
Mother Sultan, open your eyes.

803
01:15:25,560 --> 01:15:28,310
Open your eyes, come on.

804
01:15:29,880 --> 01:15:31,260
Come on!

805
01:15:31,920 --> 01:15:34,710
Call Kumral Abdal quickly,
she's not vomiting

806
01:15:42,720 --> 01:15:44,280
My Sultan.

807
01:16:11,685 --> 01:16:13,575
We have arrived, Osman Bey!

808
01:16:27,925 --> 01:16:29,485
Samagar is running away!

809
01:16:31,055 --> 01:16:32,595
Alps!

810
01:16:33,455 --> 01:16:34,845
Let's go, alps!

811
01:17:07,325 --> 01:17:09,905
Who would dare to do such a thing?

812
01:17:11,055 --> 01:17:12,875
Whoever did this...

813
01:17:13,785 --> 01:17:16,465
...It is clear that they
want to play with their life.

814
01:17:20,965 --> 01:17:22,745
Mother Sultan?

815
01:17:22,785 --> 01:17:24,675
Do you hear me? Are you well?

816
01:17:32,755 --> 01:17:34,335
Kumral Abdal.

817
01:17:34,485 --> 01:17:36,525
What is happening?
Why didn't she wake up?

818
01:17:36,755 --> 01:17:38,345
Say quickly, is she poisoned?

819
01:17:38,895 --> 01:17:46,005
No, the concern eating Mother Sultan inside
made her weak.

820
01:17:47,445 --> 01:17:49,015
But she's fine.

821
01:17:49,735 --> 01:17:53,255
You should take care of
her health for a while.

822
01:17:53,975 --> 01:17:57,975
In particular, she should
stay away from worry and sadness

823
01:18:17,795 --> 01:18:21,375
I'll have a decent meal cooked
for our Sultan.

824
01:18:41,615 --> 01:18:42,935
Esma!

825
01:18:44,265 --> 01:18:45,605
Bengi Hatun.

826
01:18:45,695 --> 01:18:46,755
Tell me quickly.

827
01:18:46,795 --> 01:18:48,535
What is happening in the palace?

828
01:18:48,565 --> 01:18:50,005
Come on, tell me.

829
01:18:50,005 --> 01:18:51,655
What does Malhun say about Bala?

830
01:18:54,165 --> 01:18:56,745
Say quickly, is there anything?
Come on, tell me.

831
01:18:57,455 --> 01:18:59,305
Don't, Bengi Hatun.

832
01:18:59,745 --> 01:19:01,515
Let's not interfere anymore.

833
01:19:02,840 --> 01:19:05,390
Have you give up on your sister, Esma?

834
01:19:13,780 --> 01:19:15,330
it's a game.

835
01:19:17,310 --> 01:19:19,640
Bala Hatun and Malhun Hatun.

836
01:19:23,530 --> 01:19:25,860
They are playing
a game on Mother Sultan.

837
01:19:30,440 --> 01:19:31,950
There is more.

838
01:20:22,280 --> 01:20:23,790
Come to me.

839
01:20:23,830 --> 01:20:26,850
Game over Osman, my soldiers will kill you!

840
01:20:54,510 --> 01:20:59,070
If I help the Mongols,
Osman will kill me.

841
01:20:59,530 --> 01:21:03,620
...and if I help Osman,
Mother Sultan will kill me.

842
01:21:05,290 --> 01:21:07,140
I know what I'm going to do.

843
01:21:10,430 --> 01:21:11,750
Look at me.

844
01:21:12,120 --> 01:21:13,120
Stop.

845
01:21:20,230 --> 01:21:21,460
Hit me.

846
01:21:21,540 --> 01:21:22,950
What are you saying, my Bey?

847
01:21:22,950 --> 01:21:24,430
Hit me hard!

848
01:21:24,510 --> 01:21:26,310
- How can I hit you my Bey?
- Come on!

849
01:21:37,410 --> 01:21:39,690
Hit me like that, come on!

850
01:21:47,760 --> 01:21:49,520
My Bey!
My Bey!

851
01:21:49,720 --> 01:21:51,740
You hit like I'm your enemy, you dog!

852
01:21:54,530 --> 01:21:56,050
What are you doing my Bey?

853
01:21:56,110 --> 01:21:57,670
Don't touch!

854
01:22:18,450 --> 01:22:19,780
Let's go.

855
01:22:19,820 --> 01:22:21,400
Let's go my Bey.

856
01:22:21,400 --> 01:22:23,000
We are coming, my Bey!

857
01:22:33,010 --> 01:22:34,650
I am coming, Osman Bey!

858
01:22:47,460 --> 01:22:49,690
Bayindir again.

859
01:22:50,430 --> 01:22:52,000
Come on now.

860
01:23:09,680 --> 01:23:11,900
You are setting the games...

861
01:23:12,640 --> 01:23:14,980
...we fall into them, huh?

862
01:23:20,710 --> 01:23:21,880
There is no such thing.

863
01:23:31,060 --> 01:23:33,390
We are the ones who set the game...

864
01:23:34,540 --> 01:23:36,680
We are the ones who ruin your game.

865
01:23:38,930 --> 01:23:42,190
And this game will end
with me cutting your head.

866
01:23:46,180 --> 01:23:47,950
You traitorous dog!

867
01:23:50,740 --> 01:23:54,780
Erlik Khan's wrath will burn you, Osman.

868
01:23:55,290 --> 01:23:58,270
When Ghazan Khan hears what you did...

869
01:23:58,530 --> 01:24:01,190
And when he learns that you helped
Sultan Mesut...

870
01:24:01,430 --> 01:24:03,680
He will turn your land into hell!

871
01:24:03,680 --> 01:24:07,270
You are turning the land you pass
into hell.

872
01:24:08,440 --> 01:24:09,990
But we...

873
01:24:10,520 --> 01:24:13,700
...water the lands with our blood...

874
01:24:15,180 --> 01:24:17,720
...in order to turn them into heaven.

875
01:24:18,870 --> 01:24:21,700
This is the difference between us.

876
01:24:26,750 --> 01:24:28,880
Bayindir, the head of Cavundur.

877
01:24:31,400 --> 01:24:35,530
Do you see who stands against us?

878
01:24:37,800 --> 01:24:39,650
I will go to the Sky God.

879
01:24:40,420 --> 01:24:45,600
But your sword will cut off
your own head!

880
01:24:46,410 --> 01:24:48,510
The head you cut is not mine.

881
01:24:49,880 --> 01:24:51,510
It's the head of your own people!

882
01:24:51,510 --> 01:24:54,120
He, who is afraid to sacrifice his head,
cannot remain free.

883
01:24:55,600 --> 01:24:59,660
He, who does not pursue his cause
in order to be free, is not of us.

884
01:25:02,470 --> 01:25:04,210
Look at me dog.

885
01:25:05,400 --> 01:25:07,950
I am not the captive sultan in Konya.

886
01:25:08,640 --> 01:25:11,190
I am not a Bey who is afraid of you.

887
01:25:25,720 --> 01:25:37,740
I am the one who planted the seeds of a
country that will rule the world.

888
01:25:42,600 --> 01:25:45,140
Tell the cruels that I sent to hell.

889
01:25:52,660 --> 01:25:56,640
I am the nightmare of the oppressors.

890
01:25:57,800 --> 01:25:59,610
And protector of innocents.

891
01:26:02,000 --> 01:26:03,530
I am Osman Bey.

892
01:26:30,630 --> 01:26:32,180
Bala!

893
01:26:35,750 --> 01:26:40,300
You have to ask permission,
Bengi Hatun.

894
01:26:44,480 --> 01:26:46,240
Bala Hatun has just left.

895
01:26:47,190 --> 01:26:48,530
What is this panic about?

896
01:26:50,120 --> 01:26:51,930
This is all a trap, my Sultan.

897
01:26:53,710 --> 01:26:55,080
Bala is playing a game.

898
01:26:55,440 --> 01:26:57,160
She came here to take the seal.

899
01:27:13,600 --> 01:27:18,640
Find Bala Hatun immediately.
Bring her to me.

900
01:27:37,270 --> 01:27:38,770
Alps!

901
01:27:39,500 --> 01:27:41,220
Track her! Come on!

902
01:27:41,220 --> 01:27:42,950
Mount now!

903
01:27:43,140 --> 01:27:45,730
We're not coming back
until we catch that rebel!

904
01:27:59,810 --> 01:28:01,120
Take him away.

905
01:28:10,890 --> 01:28:14,880
And deliver this to its owner.

906
01:28:16,650 --> 01:28:17,800
Your command, my Bey.

907
01:28:18,160 --> 01:28:19,500
Ayaz!

908
01:28:25,130 --> 01:28:26,660
Come closer.

909
01:28:28,620 --> 01:28:29,940
Come closer.

910
01:28:32,310 --> 01:28:33,650
Come.

911
01:28:39,900 --> 01:28:41,490
Osman Bey.

912
01:28:41,610 --> 01:28:44,830
I stood with you and your alps.

913
01:28:45,290 --> 01:28:47,340
Spare my life.

914
01:28:58,420 --> 01:29:01,010
Do you think that murder...

915
01:29:02,660 --> 01:29:04,950
...is like trade?

916
01:29:08,190 --> 01:29:10,480
There is no such trade.

917
01:29:13,740 --> 01:29:15,780
If you support the cruels...

918
01:29:20,560 --> 01:29:22,630
Then I will cut off your head.

919
01:29:26,070 --> 01:29:29,290
I will give you gold.

920
01:29:30,020 --> 01:29:34,190
The conquests you will make
require money

921
01:29:34,320 --> 01:29:36,080
My treasury is huge.

922
01:29:37,670 --> 01:29:39,420
If I killed you now...

923
01:29:40,410 --> 01:29:42,480
...all your gold would be mine, right?

924
01:29:42,680 --> 01:29:43,830
No my Bey.

925
01:29:44,240 --> 01:29:48,720
I even risk my life while fighting
to protect you, don't you see?

926
01:29:49,310 --> 01:29:51,800
How do I prove that I am loyal to you?

927
01:29:53,480 --> 01:29:55,180
You are loyal, huh?

928
01:29:56,410 --> 01:29:58,300
So, you are loyal.

929
01:30:10,230 --> 01:30:11,560
Right now...

930
01:30:13,480 --> 01:30:20,270
I will give you one chance to
show your loyalty.

931
01:30:22,240 --> 01:30:26,330
No, don't get excited right away.

932
01:30:27,540 --> 01:30:29,250
Listen to me first.

933
01:30:30,690 --> 01:30:33,100
Mother Sultan keeps Konur as a prisoner.

934
01:30:36,220 --> 01:30:39,550
You will take him from Mother Sultan
and bring him to us.

935
01:30:49,750 --> 01:30:51,080
My Bey.

936
01:30:51,160 --> 01:30:53,310
If I need this to earn your trust...

937
01:30:53,730 --> 01:30:55,510
I'll bring Konur to you.

938
01:30:56,060 --> 01:30:58,290
- Get out of my sight.
- Come on Huseyin!

939
01:30:59,870 --> 01:31:01,580
Come on.

940
01:31:23,540 --> 01:31:26,120
My Bey, Bala Hatun is late.

941
01:31:26,120 --> 01:31:27,900
There might be something bad.

942
01:31:32,960 --> 01:31:34,350
My Bey.

943
01:31:39,020 --> 01:31:40,820
Thank Allah, you are fine.

944
01:31:41,030 --> 01:31:44,070
We are fine, fine, fine

945
01:31:58,290 --> 01:31:59,670
Come on!

946
01:32:05,785 --> 01:32:09,835
Bala, game over, Bala.

947
01:32:15,725 --> 01:32:17,315
Bala!

948
01:32:25,925 --> 01:32:29,955
- Mother.
- Alcicek.

949
01:32:38,445 --> 01:32:40,325
What is happening here?

950
01:32:42,805 --> 01:32:45,305
What are you wearing?

951
01:32:45,825 --> 01:32:47,545
How do you do this to me?

952
01:32:47,545 --> 01:32:49,345
I don't know anything, mother.

953
01:32:49,875 --> 01:32:51,965
Bala Hatun gave it to me.

954
01:32:53,035 --> 01:32:56,105
Bala. Bala.

955
01:33:03,235 --> 01:33:07,185
Balaaaa!

956
01:33:18,475 --> 01:33:19,825
My Bey!

957
01:33:23,865 --> 01:33:25,245
Bala.

958
01:33:32,245 --> 01:33:33,835
Are you fine?

959
01:33:33,835 --> 01:33:35,835
We are fine, we are fine, thank Allah.

960
01:33:37,795 --> 01:33:41,145
Did you take the seal?

961
01:33:45,075 --> 01:33:46,915
We have it.

962
01:33:49,075 --> 01:33:51,625
Oh praise be!

963
01:33:59,405 --> 01:34:01,415
What are we going to do now, my Bey?

964
01:34:03,355 --> 01:34:05,915
We will take back the castles that are ours.

965
01:34:09,275 --> 01:34:13,865
No force can stand in the
way of the Sultan's seal.

966
01:34:18,545 --> 01:34:20,425
This is why I called you.

967
01:34:21,445 --> 01:34:27,605
Bala Hatun, you'll take Kulucahisar castle
with Aladdin Bey.

968
01:34:29,125 --> 01:34:34,645
Malhun Hatun, you'll take Karacahisar
castle with Orhan Bey.

969
01:34:39,385 --> 01:34:41,915
And we will take Bilecik.

970
01:34:58,065 --> 01:34:59,845
Bring it already!

971
01:34:59,845 --> 01:35:01,545
Not yet, my Bey!

972
01:35:02,415 --> 01:35:06,625
Yeah, it is heating up.
You'll do it in one blow, right?

973
01:35:10,785 --> 01:35:12,625
- My Bey.
- What?

974
01:35:12,625 --> 01:35:17,765
Are we going to take Konur secretly or?

975
01:35:21,045 --> 01:35:29,055
Whether we take him secretly or not,
Osman is already fixated on me.

976
01:35:30,715 --> 01:35:38,115
As to Mother Sultan,
if we make her our enemy, she'll end us!

977
01:35:38,275 --> 01:35:39,645
She'll end us, Huseyin!

978
01:35:41,875 --> 01:35:43,985
Come on bring it already!
It melted!

979
01:35:48,305 --> 01:35:50,575
Go easy, do it quickly!

980
01:35:50,575 --> 01:35:52,285
Okay my Bey.

981
01:35:52,285 --> 01:35:54,285
Hey, wait, stop.

982
01:35:56,905 --> 01:36:00,245
In the name of Allah, the Most Gracious,
the Most Merciful.Come on

983
01:36:03,715 --> 01:36:08,825
Mother! Mother! Mother!

984
01:36:08,905 --> 01:36:10,625
Enough!

985
01:36:15,985 --> 01:36:19,805
Even the wound didn't hurt this much!

986
01:36:23,795 --> 01:36:25,835
- My Bey?
- Huh?

987
01:36:25,835 --> 01:36:29,725
Let's say we saved Konur.

988
01:36:29,805 --> 01:36:32,835
Osman Bey will go to Ismihan Sultan...

989
01:36:33,525 --> 01:36:37,665
...and say that you saved Konur.
He wants to set you against her.

990
01:36:37,795 --> 01:36:41,875
You dowdy owl!

991
01:36:41,875 --> 01:36:45,025
Speak good words for once!

992
01:36:45,025 --> 01:36:48,665
"setting me against Mother Sultan"!
No way!

993
01:36:48,665 --> 01:36:51,195
Bring water, come on, bring water!

994
01:36:51,545 --> 01:36:53,105
Give me patience, Allah.

995
01:36:53,105 --> 01:36:54,615
Here, my Bey.

996
01:36:54,615 --> 01:36:56,365
I am already in pain and you...

997
01:37:09,205 --> 01:37:10,525
Take it.

998
01:37:13,235 --> 01:37:18,305
Until things settle...

999
01:37:19,345 --> 01:37:25,195
We must stand by Osman as much as we can.

1000
01:37:25,515 --> 01:37:30,795
He is the one who is behind every move.

1001
01:37:31,515 --> 01:37:33,385
Isn't he, Huseyin?

1002
01:37:33,525 --> 01:37:36,915
You're right sir, my Bey...

1003
01:37:38,145 --> 01:37:40,675
But what if we are choosing the wrong side?

1004
01:37:41,565 --> 01:37:43,605
Give me patience, Allah.

1005
01:37:43,605 --> 01:37:48,355
Come on, go, go away, I'll rest, go!

1006
01:37:54,045 --> 01:37:57,625
Come on, talk, come on

1007
01:38:23,825 --> 01:38:25,535
Hasn't he spoken yet?

1008
01:38:27,435 --> 01:38:28,945
Not yet

1009
01:38:31,145 --> 01:38:33,635
But he will speak

1010
01:38:37,555 --> 01:38:42,705
You are protecting Osman.
Where is Osman?

1011
01:38:44,745 --> 01:38:50,035
You made a very big mistake by
taking Osman as a friend, Konur.

1012
01:38:50,245 --> 01:38:57,765
However, as being your Mother Sultan,
I will give you one last chance.

1013
01:38:59,945 --> 01:39:03,795
You will tell us Osman's secrets.

1014
01:39:06,565 --> 01:39:14,325
And I will offer you everything you can
have in this world.

1015
01:39:17,305 --> 01:39:19,835
You don't have anything you can give me.

1016
01:39:31,065 --> 01:39:32,485
My Sultan.

1017
01:39:32,675 --> 01:39:36,925
Konur will tell us Osman's secrets.

1018
01:39:47,825 --> 01:39:50,585
What's that bag, Avci?

1019
01:39:50,905 --> 01:39:53,785
My Sultan, if you allow, I'll open it som...

1020
01:39:53,785 --> 01:39:56,875
Cut it out, Avci!

1021
01:39:58,525 --> 01:40:00,515
Osman Bey sent it.

1022
01:40:21,025 --> 01:40:24,725
This is the end of those
who walk in your path.

1023
01:40:30,765 --> 01:40:36,785
I won't kill you right now just because
the things you'll say.

1024
01:40:39,195 --> 01:40:45,405
Your mind will be amazed at what
I will do to you when I am done with you.

1025
01:40:54,365 --> 01:40:56,475
Bilecik Castle.

1026
01:41:03,275 --> 01:41:08,925
Olof, Osman, Osman is here!

1027
01:41:11,375 --> 01:41:13,125
Osman?

1028
01:41:37,565 --> 01:41:40,125
This is my castle, Osman!

1029
01:41:40,125 --> 01:41:42,125
You can't enter here like that!

1030
01:41:42,125 --> 01:41:45,205
This is not your castle!

1031
01:41:58,395 --> 01:42:02,165
Commander, what happened?

1032
01:42:02,165 --> 01:42:05,215
Is this how you take care of the entrustment?

1033
01:42:09,895 --> 01:42:14,725
The only entrustment
here is your life, Osman.

1034
01:42:23,365 --> 01:42:29,885
This is my castle, by the order of Sultan.

1035
01:42:38,495 --> 01:42:40,355
It won't be that easy this time!

1036
01:42:40,355 --> 01:42:42,355
Soldiers!

1037
01:42:44,975 --> 01:42:47,215
Not just Bilecik.

1038
01:42:49,635 --> 01:42:54,795
Also Karacahisar and Kulucahisar...

1039
01:42:56,325 --> 01:42:59,865
...are now mine as they were before.

1040
01:43:06,995 --> 01:43:08,805
Sogut.

1041
01:43:28,085 --> 01:43:29,445
Stop!

1042
01:43:30,175 --> 01:43:33,275
Clear our way.
We shall reach to the khanqah.

1043
01:43:33,415 --> 01:43:35,705
Where do you come from
and where are you going?

1044
01:43:35,705 --> 01:43:38,505
We are coming from Allah
and to Him we shall return.

1045
01:43:38,505 --> 01:43:39,975
Allow us to do our job.

1046
01:43:40,635 --> 01:43:41,995
Search them!

1047
01:43:57,635 --> 01:44:00,925
- Peace be upon you
- Peace be upon you too.

1048
01:44:03,485 --> 01:44:06,675
Did they do something wrong, valiants?

1049
01:44:06,755 --> 01:44:10,825
We are obliged. We were commanded, my sheik.
We have to take a look at the carriage.

1050
01:44:11,335 --> 01:44:13,115
Go ahead, take a look.

1051
01:44:18,855 --> 01:44:20,735
This carriage is loaded with apples.

1052
01:44:40,525 --> 01:44:43,095
Those apples are the right of valiants.

1053
01:44:43,965 --> 01:44:45,975
Give apples to the heroes.

1054
01:44:46,775 --> 01:44:49,575
No, my Sheikh. We shouldn't eat
what's sent for the khanqah.

1055
01:44:49,575 --> 01:44:52,595
No, it's not the issue.

1056
01:44:53,035 --> 01:44:57,155
This carriage is full of apples too.
It's more than enough for the khanqah.

1057
01:44:57,435 --> 01:45:00,595
Come on, don't refuse the offer.

1058
01:45:00,595 --> 01:45:02,815
Thank you, my Sheik.
Excuse us.

1059
01:45:02,815 --> 01:45:04,135
Eyvallah. (No problem)

1060
01:45:24,285 --> 01:45:27,215
May Allah facilitate your work, valiants.

1061
01:45:36,095 --> 01:45:40,595
The order is clear, Olof.
We'll give castle to Osman Bey.

1062
01:46:09,895 --> 01:46:12,765
Not just Bilecik...

1063
01:46:27,985 --> 01:46:29,995
Other properties as well...

1064
01:46:33,005 --> 01:46:38,975
They are under our rule
as they were before

1065
01:46:41,550 --> 01:46:43,550
Move!

1066
01:47:16,630 --> 01:47:19,500
Kulucahisar Castle.

1067
01:47:43,450 --> 01:47:47,510
I will take back
what you took from me, Osman!

1068
01:47:48,460 --> 01:47:51,230
But it'll be bloody unlike the first time!

1069
01:47:51,230 --> 01:47:57,400
I will make banners out of your skin
and of those who stand by you!

1070
01:48:00,700 --> 01:48:03,220
You don't even have a homeland.

1071
01:48:04,740 --> 01:48:07,270
First, find a home to sleep.

1072
01:48:10,650 --> 01:48:12,190
But watch out...

1073
01:48:13,410 --> 01:48:21,090
Be careful about the wolves outside.
They may bite you.

1074
01:49:12,800 --> 01:49:15,400
Yenisehir Osman Bey's palace.

1075
01:49:31,710 --> 01:49:34,220
When will I hold the sword like you two?

1076
01:49:34,690 --> 01:49:36,810
Why am I not like you?

1077
01:49:36,930 --> 01:49:38,380
I'm weak!

1078
01:49:45,180 --> 01:49:49,600
Strength isn't measured
only by muscle, daughter.

1079
01:49:50,590 --> 01:49:54,730
How am I going to beat my enemy
if my arms are not strong, Kumral Abdal?

1080
01:49:54,870 --> 01:49:56,100
Look at her!

1081
01:49:56,450 --> 01:50:00,410
It seems that you have not heard the story
of the lion and the man of the forest.

1082
01:50:00,750 --> 01:50:02,800
We haven't either, Kumral Abdal.

1083
01:50:03,960 --> 01:50:06,120
You should tell it.

1084
01:50:06,310 --> 01:50:09,050
So, come on, let's sit.

1085
01:50:21,000 --> 01:50:27,000
Once upon a time, there was a forest man.

1086
01:50:27,270 --> 01:50:31,330
This forest man used to go to the forest
after every Fajr prayer.

1087
01:50:31,520 --> 01:50:37,260
He searches for the toughest
and best types of firewood and chops them.

1088
01:50:37,440 --> 01:50:41,560
And in the evening he returns
home with the firewood he has collected.

1089
01:50:41,940 --> 01:50:46,260
And at some point when
he was looking for firewood...

1090
01:50:46,640 --> 01:50:53,780
The lion, the king of the jungle,
comes roaring with all his might!

1091
01:50:54,050 --> 01:50:58,710
He said to the forest man:
"I am amazed at your intelligence"

1092
01:50:59,000 --> 01:51:02,290
The forest man said to the lion: "Why?"

1093
01:51:02,790 --> 01:51:05,520
The lion said: "Why would it be?

1094
01:51:06,150 --> 01:51:09,830
"I am the king of the jungle
and I am very strong"

1095
01:51:10,130 --> 01:51:11,970
"Even I can't chop those trees"

1096
01:51:12,130 --> 01:51:15,970
"How are you going to chop them?"

1097
01:51:17,330 --> 01:51:21,220
The forest man was very brave.

1098
01:51:21,790 --> 01:51:28,820
He said to the lion:
"O lion, I am stronger than you"

1099
01:51:31,130 --> 01:51:33,600
The lion couldn't take that word.

1100
01:51:34,060 --> 01:51:40,560
Then he said to him:
"Come on, let's wrestle and see who is stronger"

1101
01:51:42,130 --> 01:51:43,890
And the conflict began

1102
01:51:46,910 --> 01:51:50,010
The jungle man was almost defeated

1103
01:51:50,010 --> 01:51:51,510
But he did not give up

1104
01:51:51,800 --> 01:51:58,840
He said to the lion: "O king of the forests,
I have forgotten most of my strength at home"

1105
01:51:59,060 --> 01:52:02,020
"This fight is not fair"

1106
01:52:03,820 --> 01:52:06,280
The lion stops and says:

1107
01:52:06,630 --> 01:52:09,680
"I won't defeat a man who fights
with half his strength"

1108
01:52:09,770 --> 01:52:12,730
"Go get your strength and then come"

1109
01:52:13,430 --> 01:52:17,450
The man of the jungle knows
how arrogant the lion is.

1110
01:52:17,630 --> 01:52:19,730
He used it in his behalf.

1111
01:52:20,050 --> 01:52:24,270
He said to the lion:
"What if you run away while I'm gone?"

1112
01:52:24,580 --> 01:52:27,890
The lion roars!

1113
01:52:28,630 --> 01:52:33,890
He roars so hard that all the animals
in the forest comes out of their holes.

1114
01:52:34,590 --> 01:52:38,110
And he approaches the forest man,
he approaches him more.

1115
01:52:39,270 --> 01:52:44,130
And he says to him: "I am not afraid of anyone!"

1116
01:52:44,480 --> 01:52:46,290
"I am the strongest!"

1117
01:52:50,040 --> 01:52:52,570
The forest man is not convinced.

1118
01:52:52,870 --> 01:52:56,680
He said to the lion: "No, I will fight
you with half of my strength"

1119
01:52:57,260 --> 01:52:59,430
The lion didn't accept this situation.

1120
01:53:00,790 --> 01:53:04,720
The forest man pretended as if
he has another idea.

1121
01:53:05,540 --> 01:53:09,880
He looked at the rope lying on the ground
near them, then at the lion.

1122
01:53:10,210 --> 01:53:14,100
Then he says: "Okay, I'll go."

1123
01:53:15,100 --> 01:53:17,010
"I will fetch my strength and come, but...

1124
01:53:17,180 --> 01:53:20,230
...I have to make sure
you'll wait for me here"

1125
01:53:20,560 --> 01:53:26,360
He said to him: I will tie you to that tree
and you will wait for me until I return"

1126
01:53:26,670 --> 01:53:28,020
The lion says: No!

1127
01:53:28,210 --> 01:53:30,520
"I can't accept that!"

1128
01:53:31,400 --> 01:53:35,240
The forest man looks
at the lion sarcastically.

1129
01:53:36,560 --> 01:53:39,990
And he says to the lion:
"I knew you would run away."

1130
01:53:40,790 --> 01:53:42,800
The lion gets annoyed.

1131
01:53:44,250 --> 01:53:48,240
The lion says: "Well, tie me up,
and bring your strength, and then come"

1132
01:53:48,410 --> 01:53:50,300
"I will never run away"

1133
01:53:50,970 --> 01:53:55,550
Forest man ties the lion to the tree.

1134
01:53:55,660 --> 01:53:57,450
But he doesn't leave.

1135
01:53:57,820 --> 01:54:01,610
Rather, he hit the lion with
the stick in his hand.

1136
01:54:01,720 --> 01:54:06,780
He hits him non-stop.

1137
01:54:06,980 --> 01:54:09,310
Well, what did the lion do, Komral Abdul?

1138
01:54:09,430 --> 01:54:18,020
He says to forest man: "Human, either
kill me at once or let me go"

1139
01:54:18,030 --> 01:54:19,850
"But don't play with my ego"

1140
01:54:20,130 --> 01:54:21,680
"I can't stand it"

1141
01:54:22,240 --> 01:54:25,590
"Well, I accept that you are strong"

1142
01:54:25,790 --> 01:54:29,260
The lion says to the man:
"You defeated me with your mind"

1143
01:54:29,590 --> 01:54:31,480
But the forest man doesn't stop.

1144
01:54:31,980 --> 01:54:37,180
He continues hitting
him with the stick in his hand.

1145
01:54:37,820 --> 01:54:43,320
And he says to the lion:
"O lion, O king of the forests"

1146
01:54:44,210 --> 01:54:47,690
"You waste your strength
because of your ego"

1147
01:54:48,110 --> 01:54:53,280
"As for my strength, it increases with
the mind that my Creator has given me"

1148
01:54:53,790 --> 01:54:58,780
"The more you see yourself as big,
the more you will get beaten"

1149
01:54:59,520 --> 01:55:02,620
"And you will embarass yourself"

1150
01:55:03,300 --> 01:55:08,940
Meanwhile, the tiger, who is the biggest
enemy of the lion in the forest, passes by.

1151
01:55:09,320 --> 01:55:12,890
The tiger laughs a lot
when he sees the lion in that situation.

1152
01:55:13,030 --> 01:55:14,530
The tiger mocks the lion.

1153
01:55:15,240 --> 01:55:24,010
And the tiger says to the lion: "Huge lion!
Weren't you the biggest?"

1154
01:55:24,250 --> 01:55:29,150
"Look at where you are now!
Shame on you!" the tiger says.

1155
01:55:30,620 --> 01:55:35,460
The lion looks at the tiger for a long time.

1156
01:55:35,460 --> 01:55:37,470
The lion looks awful.

1157
01:55:37,760 --> 01:55:43,410
As if that roaring lion was gone
and a quiet cat replaced him.

1158
01:55:43,900 --> 01:55:50,740
The lion says to the tiger: "no matter what
you do just don't fell into a human's trap."

1159
01:55:51,250 --> 01:55:57,710
The lion says: "Human is strong enough to
defeat us with his mind."

1160
01:55:57,800 --> 01:56:00,210
If you don't know how to use your mind...

1161
01:56:00,810 --> 01:56:04,370
...you won't be able to defeat your enemy...

1162
01:56:04,370 --> 01:56:06,750
...even if you have paws like a lion.

1163
01:56:07,830 --> 01:56:14,380
Human thinks and moves with his mind.

1164
01:56:15,220 --> 01:56:17,310
Do not forget this.

1165
01:56:18,570 --> 01:56:21,090
I will read all your books, brother.

1166
01:56:21,090 --> 01:56:23,640
I'll straighten my mind first.

1167
01:56:23,640 --> 01:56:29,140
Then the infidels will see how
the daughter Osman Bey will defeat them.

1168
01:56:32,200 --> 01:56:36,710
Have the courage of a lion,
not his arrogance.

1169
01:56:39,060 --> 01:56:43,620
Look at the situation
of those who are arrogant.

1170
01:56:45,190 --> 01:56:48,460
We got back the property we lost,
Thank Allah, Osman Bey.

1171
01:56:49,560 --> 01:56:51,140
Yes we did.

1172
01:56:52,940 --> 01:56:54,700
We definitely did.

1173
01:56:55,610 --> 01:56:59,120
The property you caused us to lose
in the first place.

1174
01:57:00,500 --> 01:57:02,080
Was it my fault?

1175
01:57:05,200 --> 01:57:06,520
It was my fault.

1176
01:57:07,100 --> 01:57:11,140
However, as far as I know,
a fault can be corrected.

1177
01:57:14,130 --> 01:57:16,400
While you are the one
who caused all this...

1178
01:57:19,310 --> 01:57:22,270
...don't think that you played a big role
getting them back.

1179
01:57:26,060 --> 01:57:28,130
I see that
you underestimate what I've done.

1180
01:57:29,090 --> 01:57:32,830
No problem.
I'll consider my job a ant's job.

1181
01:57:33,200 --> 01:57:35,560
As long as we walk on the same path...

1182
01:57:35,560 --> 01:57:37,440
...being an ant is okay for me.

1183
01:57:38,750 --> 01:57:40,490
No.

1184
01:57:48,850 --> 01:57:50,730
Even if our goal is the same...

1185
01:57:53,130 --> 01:57:54,970
..our paths are different.

1186
01:57:58,940 --> 01:58:00,340
You chose this.

1187
01:58:00,560 --> 01:58:01,990
It was because of my anger!

1188
01:58:02,720 --> 01:58:05,230
I got angry because
my brother ignored me!

1189
01:58:06,590 --> 01:58:08,860
Anger makes a person
do things he does not want

1190
01:58:08,860 --> 01:58:10,640
You know this best, Osman Bey.

1191
01:58:10,640 --> 01:58:12,430
Yes I know.

1192
01:58:13,570 --> 01:58:14,860
Of course I do.

1193
01:58:17,320 --> 01:58:18,500
However...

1194
01:58:22,590 --> 01:58:25,280
It's time to pay for what you've done.

1195
01:58:28,460 --> 01:58:30,340
Decisions have been made.

1196
01:58:31,610 --> 01:58:33,180
Choices have been made.

1197
01:58:33,900 --> 01:58:35,650
You go your way

1198
01:58:37,800 --> 01:58:39,590
I'll go mine.

1199
01:58:47,900 --> 01:58:49,210
Anger.

1200
01:58:51,470 --> 01:58:53,170
Let it be as you say.

1201
01:58:55,740 --> 01:58:57,590
I won't walk with you anymore.

1202
01:58:58,610 --> 01:59:02,910
But you should know that
I have no hard feelings for you.

1203
01:59:03,790 --> 01:59:05,510
And I will not be against you.

1204
01:59:10,970 --> 01:59:12,720
For your safety...

1205
01:59:14,780 --> 01:59:16,540
I don't want you to stand against me.

1206
01:59:20,430 --> 01:59:25,880
Still, if you need anything...

1207
01:59:28,120 --> 01:59:33,320
Know that I will come,
even if my hands are stained with blood.

1208
01:59:35,840 --> 01:59:37,410
Farewell.

1209
01:59:41,180 --> 01:59:42,490
Eyvallah.

1210
01:59:53,910 --> 01:59:56,420
Sogut.

1211
02:00:02,385 --> 02:00:04,135
How dare you!?

1212
02:00:06,795 --> 02:00:09,365
What did you think of this place, Olof?

1213
02:00:09,425 --> 02:00:11,955
The castles you gave me...

1214
02:00:12,145 --> 02:00:14,145
...are Osman's now.

1215
02:00:14,415 --> 02:00:16,155
What are you talking about?

1216
02:00:16,435 --> 02:00:18,445
Don't make a fool of me.

1217
02:00:19,975 --> 02:00:22,285
It's your seal!

1218
02:00:22,695 --> 02:00:27,355
Osman took the castles with your seal!

1219
02:00:36,695 --> 02:00:38,165
Osman.

1220
02:00:39,465 --> 02:00:42,725
So you stole my stamp for this!

1221
02:00:44,725 --> 02:00:46,565
You gave me a promise!

1222
02:00:52,385 --> 02:00:54,765
Osman ordered you to
empty the castle...

1223
02:00:55,545 --> 02:00:58,925
...and you did nothing but leaving, huh?

1224
02:01:00,605 --> 02:01:04,175
It never occurred to you
to fight, did it?

1225
02:01:06,585 --> 02:01:07,955
Were you afraid?

1226
02:01:09,865 --> 02:01:12,455
Didn't you have the strength
to fight Osman?

1227
02:01:13,325 --> 02:01:14,905
Don't mess with me!

1228
02:01:15,895 --> 02:01:17,565
Your mask has fallen off, Sultan!

1229
02:01:19,615 --> 02:01:24,745
And your soldiers that you put under
my command have switched to Osman's sideé

1230
02:01:28,075 --> 02:01:30,085
What kind of trick is this?

1231
02:01:30,715 --> 02:01:36,535
But all of you, all of you
will witness my power!

1232
02:01:37,105 --> 02:01:40,225
Come to your senses, come to your senses!

1233
02:01:42,405 --> 02:01:43,935
Don't act stupidly!

1234
02:01:46,215 --> 02:01:49,295
This game is Osman's plan.

1235
02:01:50,405 --> 02:01:52,645
If I were to return the castles to Osman...

1236
02:01:53,925 --> 02:01:56,285
I would have come and kicked
you out of there myself!

1237
02:02:05,505 --> 02:02:07,005
Osman...

1238
02:02:09,005 --> 02:02:11,785
...you stole my stamp!

1239
02:02:12,795 --> 02:02:15,575
You stole!
You disobeyed!

1240
02:02:16,485 --> 02:02:21,965
I swear I will demolish Yenişehir
and that castle over your heads!

1241
02:02:24,225 --> 02:02:31,105
I will hang your corpse on the gates
of Yenişehir, as a lesson to the world!

1242
02:02:33,595 --> 02:02:34,715
Your people...

1243
02:02:37,870 --> 02:02:41,590
...will curse your corpse.

1244
02:02:45,285 --> 02:02:46,825
...they will curse your corpse.

1245
02:02:48,605 --> 02:02:51,135
Avci Bey, get ready.

1246
02:02:55,135 --> 02:03:01,205
I will rip out Osman's heart first.

1247
02:03:03,585 --> 02:03:05,365
We'll raid the khanqah.

1248
02:03:09,415 --> 02:03:10,665
Let's go.

1249
02:03:10,665 --> 02:03:16,515
I will come too, I will come and
make Osman pay for what he did!

1250
02:03:16,905 --> 02:03:18,415
You are late.

1251
02:03:20,165 --> 02:03:22,025
You are late.

1252
02:03:22,025 --> 02:03:23,405
No.

1253
02:03:23,535 --> 02:03:28,665
You should have shown this courage before
you handed over those castles to Osman.

1254
02:03:28,665 --> 02:03:29,855
No!

1255
02:03:29,855 --> 02:03:34,175
You're not going anywhere now, Olof!

1256
02:03:34,245 --> 02:03:35,575
No!

1257
02:03:45,965 --> 02:03:48,325
Konya Palace.

1258
02:04:02,240 --> 02:04:07,300
My Sultan, Osman Bey continues
to act waywardly.

1259
02:04:07,300 --> 02:04:14,300
My Uncle Mesut, tell me about him first,
did you find him?

1260
02:04:15,190 --> 02:04:21,080
Just as Samagar was about to find him,
Mr. Osman set a big trap.

1261
02:04:21,080 --> 02:04:26,110
He beheaded Samagar and threw his head
at the feet of our Mother Sultan.

1262
02:04:28,110 --> 02:04:30,270
You've crossed your limits, Osman.

1263
02:04:30,880 --> 02:04:34,320
My Sultan, there is more.

1264
02:04:34,320 --> 02:04:39,720
Osman Bey stole the stamp of Mother Sultan
and sealed his own letters.

1265
02:04:39,720 --> 02:04:45,270
He took the castles which are
under our Mother Sultan's rule.

1266
02:04:46,030 --> 02:04:49,780
Our Mother Sultan is waiting a
large army in Yenişehir.

1267
02:04:50,740 --> 02:04:54,800
The more I protect the rights of my people...

1268
02:04:55,030 --> 02:04:57,610
The more you've become disobedient, Osman.

1269
02:04:58,120 --> 02:05:02,310
You lit this fire, but I will stoke it.

1270
02:05:03,390 --> 02:05:07,280
Fear the wrath of my army, fear it,
Osman Bey.

1271
02:05:09,180 --> 02:05:14,830
Those who will enforce your punishment
will be at your door tomorrow.

1272
02:05:21,660 --> 02:05:26,400
Thank you so much for having me
in your place, Sheikh Edebali.

1273
02:05:28,720 --> 02:05:32,920
There is no such thing as "someone's place"
in the world, Sultan Mesut.

1274
02:05:33,580 --> 02:05:37,720
Especially the khanqah,
which is not owned by anyone.

1275
02:05:38,640 --> 02:05:43,780
It is a roof for those who have fallen,
a shadow for the exhausted,

1276
02:05:43,780 --> 02:05:46,010
and a refuge for the fugitive.

1277
02:05:50,260 --> 02:05:56,940
You lost your throne.
Our door is always open for you.

1278
02:05:58,230 --> 02:06:02,800
You know the best that Humans
never own the goods of world.

1279
02:06:03,120 --> 02:06:06,280
I have experienced this the hard way,
Sheik Edebali.

1280
02:06:07,240 --> 02:06:11,600
Osman Bey says he will remove
the black clouds over us

1281
02:06:12,220 --> 02:06:14,590
Inshallah, Inshallah.

1282
02:06:14,800 --> 02:06:17,360
Hurry up, come on, this way!

1283
02:06:17,460 --> 02:06:19,470
- What are you doing?
- Get out of my way!

1284
02:06:19,470 --> 02:06:21,390
- What's happening?
- This is a khanqah!

1285
02:06:21,390 --> 02:06:23,380
It's Ismihan Sultan's order!

1286
02:06:24,500 --> 02:06:26,700
Yenisehir Osman Bey's Palace

1287
02:06:32,900 --> 02:06:36,700
Alright, alright,
it's alright my brothers.

1288
02:06:37,800 --> 02:06:47,500
They say that: "A wound of sword is
an alp's closest friend."

1289
02:06:48,070 --> 02:06:51,620
Who says that, Cerkutay?
I have never heard of this.

1290
02:06:53,280 --> 02:06:55,310
They say.
People.

1291
02:06:55,310 --> 02:06:57,310
- Yes they do.
- Some people say it.

1292
02:07:05,300 --> 02:07:07,140
Where are you looking at?

1293
02:07:07,470 --> 02:07:09,520
When will it be ready?

1294
02:07:12,310 --> 02:07:14,010
None of your business.

1295
02:07:15,840 --> 02:07:17,580
None!

1296
02:07:18,280 --> 02:07:20,360
Care your own business.

1297
02:07:20,840 --> 02:07:23,390
Look at Aykurt instead.

1298
02:07:25,180 --> 02:07:29,110
Say, brother Gurbuz,
do you have children?

1299
02:07:29,110 --> 02:07:32,980
There was no time for marriage...

1300
02:07:32,980 --> 02:07:37,720
...due to running from one mission
to another, Aykurt brother.

1301
02:07:37,720 --> 02:07:41,830
No, no, he doesn't have time,
he doesn't have time, he doesn't have time

1302
02:07:43,540 --> 02:07:50,060
You said right, why didn't I get married?
It's high time.

1303
02:07:51,540 --> 02:07:56,960
Yes, tell this to my Bey, my Bey will
arrange your wedding in one night.

1304
02:07:57,640 --> 02:07:58,960
Definitely.

1305
02:08:02,940 --> 02:08:07,590
Who would arrange a meeting for you?
You are old!

1306
02:08:08,840 --> 02:08:13,180
It is now obligatory for me
to shed your blood

1307
02:08:13,270 --> 02:08:16,570
Let it flow, let him spill my blood!

1308
02:08:16,670 --> 02:08:20,240
- Gorbuz, brothers!
- Calm down, brothers.

1309
02:08:45,200 --> 02:08:47,950
Cerkutay! If you got thirsty in a desert...

1310
02:08:47,950 --> 02:08:51,580
I would drink the last water!
I wouldn't give you a sip!

1311
02:09:18,110 --> 02:09:20,460
She is very angry.

1312
02:09:20,560 --> 02:09:23,880
I am done!
I will starve!

1313
02:09:24,380 --> 02:09:28,230
Sister, huh? Sister?
I will make you pay for that!

1314
02:09:40,340 --> 02:09:42,380
Thank you, Hatuns.

1315
02:09:45,720 --> 02:09:49,480
- You did a great job, Bala.
- Whatever we did, we did it together.

1316
02:09:50,620 --> 02:09:52,680
- Isn't that right, Ulgen?
- Yes

1317
02:09:52,860 --> 02:09:54,720
The Chechik family also has a big stake

1318
02:09:54,720 --> 02:09:58,720
I'm very curious about what Bengi Hatun's
face looks like when she sees Alcicek.

1319
02:10:01,320 --> 02:10:03,740
So she wants to join The Sisters.

1320
02:10:05,110 --> 02:10:09,580
Praise be, brave girl!

1321
02:10:17,685 --> 02:10:20,455
Attention, Osman Bey!

1322
02:10:24,325 --> 02:10:28,095
- Peace be upon you
- And peace be upon you.

1323
02:10:30,225 --> 02:10:31,605
Go ahead

1324
02:10:37,815 --> 02:10:39,345
Come on.

1325
02:10:55,385 --> 02:10:58,695
They thought they could capture us.

1326
02:10:59,805 --> 02:11:04,505
But the one thing they couldn't think of
was our bravery.

1327
02:11:06,405 --> 02:11:12,095
We have restored our forts and castles,
with the permission of my Allah.

1328
02:11:16,935 --> 02:11:20,655
Come on then, enjoy your meal.

1329
02:11:22,655 --> 02:11:25,365
In The Name of Allah
Most Gracious Most Merciful

1330
02:11:27,365 --> 02:11:30,405
In The Name of Allah
Most Gracious Most Merciful

1331
02:11:47,085 --> 02:11:49,165
May I come, my Bey?

1332
02:11:49,965 --> 02:11:51,355
Come!

1333
02:11:54,445 --> 02:11:57,025
My Bey, they raided the khanqah!

1334
02:12:00,405 --> 02:12:01,925
Father!

1335
02:12:07,175 --> 02:12:08,985
What are you saying?

1336
02:12:16,575 --> 02:12:18,315
Sultan Mesut.

1337
02:12:20,135 --> 02:12:21,665
My sheik!

1338
02:12:28,085 --> 02:12:30,895
If they are hurt...

1339
02:12:32,895 --> 02:12:36,445
...I will make their lives unbearable!

1340
02:12:40,085 --> 02:12:53,495
Please contact turkision@gmail.com for any inquiries